#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1127
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1149
#: xml_doc.cpp:4614 xml_doc.cpp:4641 xml_doc.cpp:4662
msgid "Digits"
msgstr "Steden"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1106
#: xml_doc.cpp:4617
msgid ""
"The ROUND(value;[digits]) function returns value rounded. Digits is the "
"number of digits to which you want to round that number. If digits is zero "
"or omitted, value is rounded up to the nearest integer. If digits is smaller "
"than zero, the corresponding integer part of the number is rounded."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ROUND(Weert;[Steden]) gifft en rundt Weert torüch. \"Steden\" "
"is de Tall vun Nakommasteden, na de de Tall rundt warrn schall. Wenn \"Steden"
"\" Null oder weglaten is, warrt \"Weert\" na de dichtst bi leggen Heeltall "
"rundt. Wenn \"Steden\" lütter as Null is, warrt de Tall ehr tohören "
"Heeltalldeel rundt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1107
#: xml_doc.cpp:4620
msgid "ROUND(value;[digits])"
msgstr "ROUND(Weert;[Steden])"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1108
#: xml_doc.cpp:4623
msgid "ROUND(1.252;2) equals 1.25"
msgstr "ROUND(1,252;2) gifft \"1,25\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1109
#: xml_doc.cpp:4626
msgid "ROUND(-1.252;2) equals -1.25"
msgstr "ROUND(-1,252;2) gifft \"-1,25\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1110
#: xml_doc.cpp:4629
msgid "ROUND(1.258;2) equals 1.26"
msgstr "ROUND(1,258;2) gifft \"1,26\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1111
#: xml_doc.cpp:4632
msgid "ROUND(-12.25;-1) equals -10"
msgstr "ROUND(-12,25;-1) gifft \"-10\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1112
#: xml_doc.cpp:4635
msgid "ROUND(-1.252;0) equals -1"
msgstr "ROUND(-1,252;0) gifft \"-1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1131
#: xml_doc.cpp:4644
msgid ""
"The ROUNDUP(value;[digits]) function returns value rounded up. Digits is the "
"number of digits to which you want to round that number. If digits is zero "
"or omitted, value is rounded up to the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ROUNDUP(Weert;[Steden]) gifft en oprundt Weert torüch. \"Steden"
"\" is de Tall vun Nakommasteden, na de de Tall rundt warrn schall. Wenn "
"\"Steden\" Null oder weglaten is, warrt \"Weert\" na de dichtst bi leggen "
"Heeltall oprundt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1132
#: xml_doc.cpp:4647
msgid "ROUNDUP(value;[digits])"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(Weert;[Steden])"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1133
#: xml_doc.cpp:4650
msgid "ROUNDUP(1.252;2) equals 1.26"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(1,252;2) gifft \"1,26\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1134
#: xml_doc.cpp:4653
msgid "ROUNDUP(-1.252;2) equals -1.25"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(-1,252;2) gifft \"-1,25\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1135
#: xml_doc.cpp:4656
msgid "ROUNDUP(-1.252) equals -1"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(-1,252) gifft \"-1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1153
#: xml_doc.cpp:4665
msgid ""
"The ROUNDDOWN(value;[digits]) function returns value rounded down. Digits is "
"the number of digits to which you want to round that number. If digits is "
"zero or omitted, value is rounded down to the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ROUNDDOWN(Weert;[Steden]) gifft en afrundt Weert torüch. "
"\"Steden\" is de Tall vun Nakommasteden, na de de Tall rundt warrn schall. "
"Wenn \"Steden\" Null oder weglaten is, warrt \"Weert\" na de dichtst bi "
"leggen Heeltall afrundt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1154
#: xml_doc.cpp:4668
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(value;[digits])"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(Weert; [Steden])"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1155
#: xml_doc.cpp:4671
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(1.252;2) equals 1.25"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(1,252;2) gifft \"1,25\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1156
#: xml_doc.cpp:4674
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(-1.252;2) equals -1.26"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(-1,252;2) gifft \"-1,26\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1157
#: xml_doc.cpp:4677
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(-1.252) equals -2"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(-1,252) gifft \"-2\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1167
#: xml_doc.cpp:4680
msgid "Nth term"
msgstr "n-t Term"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1171
#: xml_doc.cpp:4683
msgid ""
"Function FIB calculates the Nth term of a Fibonacci sequence (1, 1, 2, 3, 5, "
"8, 13, 21...), in which each number, after the first two, is the sum of the "
"two numbers immediately preceding it. FIB(0) is defined to be 0."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FIB reekt den n-t Term vun en Fibonacci-Reeg (1, 1, 2, 3, 5, "
"8, 13, 21...) ut, binnen de elk Tall na de eersten twee Tallen de Summ vun "
"de beden verleden Tallen is. FIB(0) warrt as 0 fastleggt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1172
#: xml_doc.cpp:4686
msgid "FIB(n)"
msgstr "FIB(n)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1173
#: xml_doc.cpp:4689
msgid "FIB(9) returns 34"
msgstr "FIB(9) gifft \"34\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1174
#: xml_doc.cpp:4692
msgid "FIB(26) returns 121393"
msgstr "FIB(26) gifft \"121393\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1182
#: xml_doc.cpp:4695
msgid "Numerator"
msgstr "Teller"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1186
#: xml_doc.cpp:4698
msgid "Denumerator"
msgstr "Nenner"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1190
#: xml_doc.cpp:4701
msgid "Function QUOTIENT returns the integer portion of numerator/denumerator."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon QUOTIENT() gifft den Heeltalldeel vun Teller/Nenner torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1191
#: xml_doc.cpp:4704
msgid "QUOTIENT(numerator;denumerator)"
msgstr "QUOTIENT(Teller;Nenner)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1192
#: xml_doc.cpp:4707
msgid "QUOTIENT(21;4) returns 5"
msgstr "QUOTIENT(21;4) gifft \"5\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1205
#: xml_doc.cpp:4713
msgid ""
"Function MDETERM returns the determinant of a given matrix. The matrix must "
"be of type n x n."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MDETERM gifft de Determinant vun en angeven Matrix torüch. De "
"Matrix mutt vun den Typ n x n wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1206
#: xml_doc.cpp:4716
msgid "MDETERM(matrix)"
msgstr "MDETERM(Matrix)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1207
#: xml_doc.cpp:4719
msgid "MDETERM(A1:C3)"
msgstr "MDETERM(A1:C3)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1216
#: xml_doc.cpp:4722
msgid "First matrix"
msgstr "Eerst Matrix"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1220
#: xml_doc.cpp:4725
msgid "Second matrix"
msgstr "Tweet Matrix"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1224
#: xml_doc.cpp:4728
msgid ""
"Function MMULT multiplies two matrices. Number of columns of the first "
"matrix nust be the same as row count of the second one. The result is a "
"matrix."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MMULT nimmt twee Matrizen mitenanner maal. De eersten Matrix "
"ehr Tall vun Striepen mutt de sülve wesen as de twete Matrix ehr Tall vun "
"Regen. Dat Resultaat is en Matrix."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1225
#: xml_doc.cpp:4731
msgid "MMULT(matrix1;matrix2)"
msgstr "MMULT(Matrix1;Matrix2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1226
#: xml_doc.cpp:4734
msgid "MMULT(A1:C3)"
msgstr "MMULT(A1:C3)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1235
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1268
#: xml_doc.cpp:4737 xml_doc.cpp:4767
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "Matrix"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1239
#: xml_doc.cpp:4740
msgid "Calculates the inverse of the matrix."
msgstr "Reekt de Inverschoon vun de Matrix ut."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1240
#: xml_doc.cpp:4743
msgid ""
"The matrix multiplied with its inverse results in the unity matrix of the "
"same dimension."
msgstr ""
"De Matrix, mit ehr Inverschoon maalnahmen, gifft de Eenheitmatrix vun de "
"sülve Afmeten."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1241
#: xml_doc.cpp:4746
msgid "Invertible matrices have a non-zero determinant."
msgstr "Inverteerbor Matrizen hebbt en anner Determinant as Null."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1242
#: xml_doc.cpp:4749
msgid "MINVERSE(matrix)"
msgstr "MINVERSE(Matrix)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1243
#: xml_doc.cpp:4752
msgid "MINVERSE(A1:C3)"
msgstr "MINVERSE(A1:C3)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1253
#: xml_doc.cpp:4755
msgid "Dimension"
msgstr "Afmeten"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1257
#: xml_doc.cpp:4758
msgid "Creates the unity matrix of the given dimension."
msgstr "Stellt de Eenheitmatrix vun de geven Afmeten op."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1258
#: xml_doc.cpp:4761
msgid "MUNIT(dimension)"
msgstr "MUNIT(Afmeten)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1259
#: xml_doc.cpp:4764
msgid "MUNIT(3) creates a 3x3 unity matrix"
msgstr "MUNIT(3) stellt en \"3x3\"-Eenheitmatrix op"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1272
#: xml_doc.cpp:4770
msgid ""
"Returns the transpose of a matrix, i.e. rows and columns of the matrix are "
"exchanged."
msgstr ""
"Gifft en transponeert Matrix torüch, d.h., Regen un Striepen sünd uttuuscht."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1273
#: xml_doc.cpp:4773
msgid "TRANSPOSE(matrix)"
msgstr "TRANSPOSE(Matrix)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 1274
#: xml_doc.cpp:4776
msgid "TRANSPOSE(A1:C3)"
msgstr "TRANSPOSE(A1:C3)"

#. i18n: tag GroupName
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 5
#: xml_doc.cpp:4779
msgid "Lookup & Reference"
msgstr "Naslaan un Zellbetöög"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 11
#: xml_doc.cpp:4782
msgid "Row number"
msgstr "Reegnummer"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 15
#: xml_doc.cpp:4785
msgid "Column number"
msgstr "Striepnummer"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 19
#: xml_doc.cpp:4788
msgid "Absolute number (optional)"
msgstr "Afsoluut Tall (optschonaal)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 23
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 140
#: xml_doc.cpp:4791 xml_doc.cpp:4917
msgid "A1 style (optional)"
msgstr "A1-Stil (optschonaal)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 27
#: xml_doc.cpp:4794
msgid "Sheet name"
msgstr "Tabellnaam"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 31
#: xml_doc.cpp:4797
msgid ""
"The ADDRESS creates a cell address. Parameter Row is the row number and "
"Column is the column number."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ADDRESS stellt en Zelladress op. Parameter \"Reeg\" is de "
"Reegnummer un \"Striep\" de Striepnummer."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 32
#: xml_doc.cpp:4800
msgid ""
"Absolute number specifies the type of reference: 1 or omitted = Absolute, 2 "
"= Absolute row, relative column,  3 = Relative row; absolute column and 4 = "
"Relative."
msgstr ""
"De afsoluut Tall leggt den Betog-Typ fast: 1 oder utlaten = afsoluut, 2 = "
"afsoluut Reeg, relativ Striep, 3 = relativ Reeg, afsoluut Striep un 4 = "
"relativ."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 33
#: xml_doc.cpp:4803
msgid ""
"A1 Style specifies the style of the address to return. If A1 is set to TRUE "
"(default) the address is returned in A1 style if it is set to FALSE in R1C1 "
"style."
msgstr ""
"A1 Stil leggt de Adress ehr Stil fast, de torüchgeven warrn schall. Wenn A1 "
"wohr is (Standard) warrt de Adress in'n A1-Stil torüchgeven, un in R1C1-"
"Stil, wenn för A1 \"falsch\" fastleggt is."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 34
#: xml_doc.cpp:4806
msgid "Sheet name is the text specifying the name of the sheet."
msgstr "De Tabellnaam is de Text, de de Tabell ehr Naam angifft."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 35
#: xml_doc.cpp:4809
msgid "ADDRESS(row; col; absolute; style; sheet name)"
msgstr "ADDRESS(Reeg; Striep; Afsoluut; Stil; Tabellnaam)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 36
#: xml_doc.cpp:4812
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4) returns $D$6"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4) gifft \"$D$6\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 37
#: xml_doc.cpp:4815
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4; 2) returns D$6"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4; 2) gifft \"D$6\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 38
#: xml_doc.cpp:4818
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4; 2; FALSE; \"Sheet1\") returns Sheet1!R6C[4]"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4; 2; falsch; \"Tabell1\") gifft \"Tabell1!R6C[4]\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 39
#: xml_doc.cpp:4821
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4; 1; FALSE; \"Sheet1\") returns Sheet1!R6C4"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4; 1; falsch; \"Tabell1\") gifft \"Tabell1!R6C4\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 40
#: xml_doc.cpp:4824
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4; 4; TRUE; \"Sheet1\") returns Sheet1!D6"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4; 4; wohr; \"Tabell1\") gifft \"Tabell1!D6\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 48
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 80
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 97
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 113
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 136
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 155
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 172
#: xml_doc.cpp:4827 xml_doc.cpp:4860 xml_doc.cpp:4875 xml_doc.cpp:4890
#: xml_doc.cpp:4914 xml_doc.cpp:4932 xml_doc.cpp:4947
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "Betog"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 52
#: xml_doc.cpp:4830
msgid ""
"Returns the number of areas in the reference string. An area can be asingle "
"cell or a set of cells."
msgstr ""
"Gifft de Tall vun Rebeden binnen de Betog-Tekenkeed torüch. En Rebeet kann "
"en enkelte Zell oder en Zellensett wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 53
#: xml_doc.cpp:4833
msgid "AREAS(reference)"
msgstr "AREAS(Zellbetog)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 54
#: xml_doc.cpp:4836
msgid "AREAS(A1) returns 1"
msgstr "AREAS(A1) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 55
#: xml_doc.cpp:4839
msgid "AREAS((A1; A2:A4)) returns 2"
msgstr "AREAS((A1; A2:A4)) gifft \"2\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 62
#: xml_doc.cpp:4842
msgid "Index"
msgstr "Index"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 66
#: xml_doc.cpp:4845
msgid "Arguments"
msgstr "Argumenten"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 69
#: xml_doc.cpp:4848
msgid "Returns the parameter specified by the index."
msgstr "Gifft den vun den Index angeven Parameter torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 70
#: xml_doc.cpp:4851
msgid "CHOOSE(index; parameter1; parameter2;...)"
msgstr "CHOOSE(Index; Parameter1; Parameter2;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 71
#: xml_doc.cpp:4854
msgid "CHOOSE(1; \"1st\"; \"2nd\") returns \"1st\""
msgstr "CHOOSE(1; \"eerst\"; \"tweet\") gifft \"eerst\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 72
#: xml_doc.cpp:4857
msgid "CHOOSE(2; 3; 2; 4) returns 2"
msgstr "CHOOSE(2; 3; 2; 4) gifft \"2\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 84
#: xml_doc.cpp:4863
msgid ""
"The COLUMN function returns the column of given cell reference. If no "
"parameter is specified the column of the current cell gets returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon COLUMN gifft en angeven Zellbetog sien Striep torüch. Wenn "
"keen Parameter fastleggt is warrt de aktuell Zellstriep torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 85
#: xml_doc.cpp:4866
msgid "COLUMN(reference)"
msgstr "COLUMN(Betog)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 86
#: xml_doc.cpp:4869
msgid "COLUMN(A1) returns 1"
msgstr "COLUMN(A1) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 87
#: xml_doc.cpp:4872
msgid "COLUMN(D2) returns 4"
msgstr "COLUMN(D2) gifft \"4\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 101
#: xml_doc.cpp:4878
msgid "The COLUMNS function returns the number of columns in a reference."
msgstr "De Funkschoon COLUMNS gifft de Tall vun Striepen in en Betog torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 102
#: xml_doc.cpp:4881
msgid "COLUMNS(reference)"
msgstr "COLUMNS(Betog)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 103
#: xml_doc.cpp:4884
msgid "COLUMNS(A1:C3) returns 3"
msgstr "COLUMNS(A1:C3) gifft \"3\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 104
#: xml_doc.cpp:4887
msgid "COLUMNS(D2) returns 1"
msgstr "COLUMNS(D2) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 117
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 217
#: xml_doc.cpp:4893 xml_doc.cpp:4986
msgid "Row"
msgstr "Reeg"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 121
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 243
#: xml_doc.cpp:4896 xml_doc.cpp:5007 dialogs/DatabaseDialog.cpp:189
msgid "Column"
msgstr "Striep"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 125
#: xml_doc.cpp:4899
msgid ""
"If a range is given, returns value stored in a given row/column. If one cell "
"is given, which contains an array, then one element of the array is returned."
msgstr ""
"Wenn en Rebeet angeven is, warrt de in en angeven Reeg/Striep spiekert Weert "
"torüchgeven. Wenn een Zell angeven is, de en Feld bargt, warrt een Element "
"vun dat Feld torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 126
#: xml_doc.cpp:4902
msgid "INDEX(cell, row, column)"
msgstr "INDEX(Zell, Reeg, Striep)"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 127
#: xml_doc.cpp:4905
msgid "INDEX(range, row, column)"
msgstr "INDEX(Rebeet, Reeg, Striep)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 128
#: xml_doc.cpp:4908
msgid "INDEX(A1:C3;2;2), returns contents of B2"
msgstr "INDEX(A1:C3,2,2) gifft den Inholt vun B2 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 129
#: xml_doc.cpp:4911
msgid ""
"INDEX(A1;2;2), if A1 is a result of array calculation, returns its (2,2) "
"element."
msgstr ""
"INDEX(A1;2;2) gifft sien (2,2) Element torüch, wenn A1 en Resultaat vun en "
"Feldutreken is."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 144
#: xml_doc.cpp:4920
msgid ""
"Returns the content of the cell specified by the reference text. The second "
"parameter is optional."
msgstr ""
"Gifft den Inholt vun de dör den Betogtext angeven Zell torüch. De twete "
"Parameter is optschonaal."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 145
#: xml_doc.cpp:4923
msgid "INDIRECT(referenceText, a1 style)"
msgstr "INDIRECT(Betog, A1 Stil)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 146
#: xml_doc.cpp:4926
msgid "INDIRECT(A1), A1 contains \"B1\", and B1 1 => returns 1"
msgstr "INDIRECT(A1), A1 bargt \"B1\", un B1 1 => gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 147
#: xml_doc.cpp:4929
msgid "INDIRECT(\"A1\"), returns content of A1"
msgstr "INDIRECT(\"A1\"), gifft den Inholt vun A1 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 159
#: xml_doc.cpp:4935
msgid ""
"The ROW function returns the row of given cell reference. If no parameter is "
"specified the row of the current cell gets returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ROW gifft de Reeg vun en angeven Zellbetog torüch. Wenn keen "
"Parameter fastleggt is warrt de aktuell Zellreeg torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 160
#: xml_doc.cpp:4938
msgid "ROW(reference)"
msgstr "ROW(Betog)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 161
#: xml_doc.cpp:4941
msgid "ROW(A1) returns 1"
msgstr "ROW(A1) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 162
#: xml_doc.cpp:4944
msgid "ROW(D2) returns 2"
msgstr "ROW(D2) gifft \"2\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 176
#: xml_doc.cpp:4950
msgid "The ROWS function returns the number of rows in a reference."
msgstr "De Funkschoon ROWS gifft de Tall vun Regen binnen en Betog torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 177
#: xml_doc.cpp:4953
msgid "ROWS(reference)"
msgstr "ROWS(Betog)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 178
#: xml_doc.cpp:4956
msgid "ROWS(A1:C3) returns 3"
msgstr "ROWS(A1:C3) gifft \"3\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 179
#: xml_doc.cpp:4959
msgid "ROWS(D2) returns 1"
msgstr "ROWS(D2) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 187
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 209
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 235
#: xml_doc.cpp:4962 xml_doc.cpp:4980 xml_doc.cpp:5001
msgid "Lookup value"
msgstr "Söökweert"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 191
#: xml_doc.cpp:4965
msgid "Lookup vector"
msgstr "Söökvektor"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 195
#: xml_doc.cpp:4968
msgid "Result vector"
msgstr "Resultaatvektor"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 199
#: xml_doc.cpp:4971
msgid ""
"The LOOKUP function looks up the first parameter in the lookup vector. It "
"returns a value in the result Vector with the same index as the matching "
"value in the lookup vector. If value is not in the lookup vector it takes "
"the next lower one. If no value in the lookup vector matches an error is "
"returned. The lookup vector must be in ascending order and lookup and result "
"vector must have the same size. Numeric values, string and boolean values "
"are recognized. Comparison between strings is case-insensitive."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon LOOKUP söökt den eersten Parameter binnen den Söökvektor. Se "
"gifft en Weert binnen den Resultaatvektor mit den sülven Index as den passen "
"Weert binnen den Söökvektor torüch. Wenn de Söökvektor den Weert nich bargt, "
"warrt de nakamen sieter Weert nahmen. Wenn keen Weert binnen den Söökvektor "
"passt, warrt en Fehler torüchgeven. De Söökvektor mutt in opstegen Reeg un "
"Söök- un Resultaatvektor mööt gliek groot wesen. Numeersch Weerten, "
"Tekenkeden un boolsch Weerten warrt annahmen. Bi't Verglieken vun Tekenkeden "
"warrt op Groot-/Lüttschrieven oppasst."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 200
#: xml_doc.cpp:4974
msgid "LOOKUP(value; lookup vector; result vector)"
msgstr "LOOKUP(Weert; Söökvektor; Resultaatvektor)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 201
#: xml_doc.cpp:4977
msgid "LOOKUP(1.232; A1:A6; B1:B6) for A1 = 1, A2 = 2 returns the value of B1."
msgstr ""
"LOOKUP(1.232; A1:A6; B1:B6) för A1 = 1, A2 = 2 gifft den Weert vun B1 torüch."

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 213
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 239
#: xml_doc.cpp:4983 xml_doc.cpp:5004
msgid "Data source"
msgstr "Datenborn"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 221
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 247
#: xml_doc.cpp:4989 xml_doc.cpp:5010
msgid "Sorted (optional)"
msgstr "Sorteren (optschonaal)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 225
#: xml_doc.cpp:4992
msgid ""
"Look for a matching value in the first row of the given table, and return the value of the "
"indicated row."
msgstr ""
"Binnen de eerst Reeg vun en geven Tabell en passen Weert söken, un den Weert "
"vun de wiest Reeg utgeven."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 226
#: xml_doc.cpp:4995
msgid ""
"Looks up the 'lookup value' in the first row of the 'data source'. If a "
"value matches, the value in the 'row' and the column, the value was found "
"in, is returned. If 'sorted' is true (default), the first row is assumed to "
"be sorted. The search will end, if the 'lookup value' is lower than the "
"value, currently compared to."
msgstr ""
"Söökt den \"Söökweert\" binnen de eerst Reeg vun \"Datenborn\". Wenn en "
"Weert passt, warrt de Weert in de \"Reeg\" un de Striep, in den he funnen "
"wöör, utgeven. Wenn \"Sorteren\" anmaakt is (Standard), warrt de eerst Reeg "
"sorteert. De Söök warrt beendt, wenn de \"Söökweert\" sieter is as de Weert, "
"mit den he opstunns vergleken warrt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 227
#: xml_doc.cpp:4998
msgid "HLOOKUP(Lookup value; data source; Row; Sorted)"
msgstr "HLOOKUP(Söökweert; Datenborn; Reeg; Sorteren)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 251
#: xml_doc.cpp:5013
msgid ""
"Look for a matching value in the first column of the given table, and return the value of the "
"indicated column."
msgstr ""
"Binnen den eerst Striep vun en geven Tabell en passen Weert söken, un den "
"Weert vun den wiest Striep utgeven."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 252
#: xml_doc.cpp:5016
msgid ""
"Looks up the 'lookup value' in the first column of the 'data source'. If a "
"value matches, the value in the 'column' and the row, the value was found "
"in, is returned. If 'sorted' is true (default), the first column is assumed "
"to be sorted. The search will end, if the 'lookup value' is lower than the "
"value, currently compared to."
msgstr ""
"Söökt den \"Söökweert\" in den eerst Striep vun \"Datenborn\". Wenn en Weert "
"passt, warrt de Weert in den \"Striep\" un de Reeg, in de he funnen wöör, "
"utgeven. Wenn \"Sorteren\" anmaakt is (Standard), warrt de eerst Striep "
"sorteert. De Söök warrt beendt, wenn de \"Söökweert\" sieter is as de Weert, "
"mit den he opstunns vergleken warrt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/reference.xml line 253
#: xml_doc.cpp:5019
msgid "VLOOKUP(Lookup value; data source; Column; Sorted)"
msgstr "VLOOKUP(Söökweet; Datenborn; Striep; Sorteren)"

