#: xml_doc.cpp:5100 xml_doc.cpp:5133 xml_doc.cpp:5407 xml_doc.cpp:5437
#: xml_doc.cpp:6418
msgid "Beta parameter"
msgstr "Beta-Parameter"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 103
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 139
#: xml_doc.cpp:5103 xml_doc.cpp:5136
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Start"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 107
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 143
#: xml_doc.cpp:5106 xml_doc.cpp:5139
msgid "End"
msgstr "Enn"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 111
#: xml_doc.cpp:5109
msgid "Cumulative"
msgstr "Tosamenreekt"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 115
#: xml_doc.cpp:5112
msgid ""
"The BETADIST() function returns the cumulative beta probability density "
"function."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon BETADIST() gifft de kumuleert Beta-"
"Wohrschienlichkeitdichtfunkschoon torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 116
#: xml_doc.cpp:5115
msgid ""
"The third and fourth parameters are optional. They set the lower and upper "
"bounds, otherwise defaulting to 0.0 and 1.0 respectively."
msgstr ""
"De drüdde un de veerte Parameters sünd optschonaal. Se leggt de sietst un de "
"höögst Grenz fast. Anners warrt de Standardweerten 0,0 oder 1,0 bruukt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 117
#: xml_doc.cpp:5118
msgid "BETADIST(number;alpha;beta;start;end;[cumulative=TRUE])"
msgstr "BETADIST(Tall;Alpha;Beta;Start;Enn;[tosamenreekt=WOHR]))"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 118
#: xml_doc.cpp:5121
msgid "BETADIST(0.2859;0.2606;0.8105) equals 0.675444"
msgstr "BETADIST(0,2859;0,2606;0,8105) gifft \"0,675444\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 119
#: xml_doc.cpp:5124
msgid "BETADIST(0.2859;0.2606;0.8105;0.2;0.9) equals 0.537856"
msgstr "BETADIST(0,2859;0,2606;0,8105;0,2;0,9) gifft \"0,537856\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 147
#: xml_doc.cpp:5142
msgid ""
"The BETAINV() function returns the inverse of BETADIST(x;alpha;beta;a;b;TRUE"
"())."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon BETAINV() gifft de Inverschoon vun BETADIST(x;alpha;beta;a;b;"
"TRUE()) torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 148
#: xml_doc.cpp:5145
msgid ""
"The start and end parameters are optional. They set the lower and upper "
"bounds, otherwise defaulting to 0.0 and 1.0 respectively."
msgstr ""
"De Start- un Ennparameters sünd optschonaal. Se leggt de sietst un de höögst "
"Grenz fast. Anners warrt de Standardweerten 0,0 oder 1,0 bruukt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 149
#: xml_doc.cpp:5148
msgid "BETAINV(number;alpha;beta [; start=0 [; end=1]])"
msgstr "BETAINV(Tall;Alpha;Beta [; Start=0 [; Enn=1]])"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 150
#: xml_doc.cpp:5151
msgid "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) equals 0.1"
msgstr "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) gifft 0.1 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 151
#: xml_doc.cpp:5154
msgid "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) equals 0.3"
msgstr "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) gifft 0.3 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 164
#: xml_doc.cpp:5160
msgid "Degrees of freedom"
msgstr "Freeheitgraad"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 168
#: xml_doc.cpp:5163
msgid ""
"The CHIDIST() function returns the probability value from the indicated Chi "
"square that a hypothesis is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CHIDIST() gifft den Wohrschienlichkeitsweert vun dat angeven "
"Chi-Quadraat torüch, dat en Vermoden beglöövt warrt."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 169
#: xml_doc.cpp:5166
msgid ""
"CHIDIST compares the Chi square value to be given for a random sample that "
"is calculated from the sum of (observed value-expected value)^2/expected "
"value for all values with the theoretical Chi square distribution and "
"determines from this the probability of error for the hypothesis to be "
"tested."
msgstr ""
"CHIDIST vergliekt den Weert vun Chi-Quadraat för en tofällig Steekproov, de "
"ut de Summ vun \"(beluert Weert-verwacht Weert)^2/verwacht Weert\" för all "
"Weerten mit mööglich Chi-Quadraatverdelen un reekt dor de "
"Fehlerwohrschienlichkeit för de Vermoden mit ut, de pröövt warrn schall."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 170
#: xml_doc.cpp:5169
msgid "CHIDIST(number;degrees_freedom)"
msgstr "CHIDIST(Tall;Freeheitgraad)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 171
#: xml_doc.cpp:5172
msgid "CHIDIST(13.27;5) returns 0.021"
msgstr "CHIDIST(13,27;5) gifft \"0,021\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 179
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 198
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 931
#: xml_doc.cpp:5175 xml_doc.cpp:5193 xml_doc.cpp:5836
msgid "Total number of elements"
msgstr "Tall vun Elementen"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 183
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 202
#: xml_doc.cpp:5178 xml_doc.cpp:5196
msgid "Number of elements to choose"
msgstr "Tall vun utsöökbor Elementen"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 187
#: xml_doc.cpp:5181
msgid ""
"The COMBIN() function calculates the count of possible combinations. The "
"first parameter is the total count of elements. The second parameter is the "
"count of elements to choose. Both parameters should be positive and the "
"first parameter should not be less than the second. Otherwise the function "
"returns an error."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon COMBIN() reekt de Tall vun mööglich Kombinatschonen ut. De "
"eerste Parameter is de Tall vun all Elementen tosamen. De twete Parameter is "
"de Tall vun Elementen för de Köör. Beed Parameters mööt positiv wesen un de "
"eerste Parameter schall nich lütter wesen as de twete. Anners gifft de "
"Funkschoon en Fehler ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 188
#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 207
#: xml_doc.cpp:5184 xml_doc.cpp:5202
msgid "COMBIN(total;chosen)"
msgstr "COMBIN(tosamen;utsöcht)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 189
#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 208
#: xml_doc.cpp:5187 xml_doc.cpp:5205
msgid "COMBIN(12;5) returns 792"
msgstr "COMBIN(12;5) gifft \"792\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 190
#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 209
#: xml_doc.cpp:5190 xml_doc.cpp:5208
msgid "COMBIN(5;5) returns 1"
msgstr "COMBIN(5;5) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 206
#: xml_doc.cpp:5199
msgid ""
"The COMBINA() function calculates the count of possible combinations. The "
"first parameter is the total count of elements. The second parameter is the "
"count of elements to choose. Both parameters should be positive and the "
"first parameter should not be less than the second. Otherwise the function "
"returns an error."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon COMBINA() reekt de Tall vun mööglich Kombinatschonen ut. De "
"eerst Parameter is de Tall vun all Elementen tosamen. De tweet Parameter is "
"de Tall vun Elementen för de Köör. Beed Parameters mööt positiv wesen un de "
"eerste Parameter schall nich lütter wesen as de twete. Anners gifft de "
"Funkschoon en Fehler ut."

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 217
#: xml_doc.cpp:5211
msgid "Level of the confidence interval"
msgstr "Stoop vun't Konfidenzrebeet"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 221
#: xml_doc.cpp:5214
msgid "Standard deviation for the total population"
msgstr "Standardverscheel för de heel Populatschoon"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 225
#: xml_doc.cpp:5217
msgid "Size of the total population"
msgstr "Grött vun de heel Populatschoon"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 229
#: xml_doc.cpp:5220
msgid ""
"The CONFIDENCE() function returns the confidence interval for a population "
"mean."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CONFIDENCE() gifft dat Konfidenzrebeet vun en Populatschoon "
"ehr Middelweert torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 230
#: xml_doc.cpp:5223
msgid ""
"The alpha parameter must be between 0 and 1 (non-inclusive), stddev must be "
"positive and size must be greater or equal to 1."
msgstr ""
"De Alpha-Parameter mutt twischen 0 un 1 liggen (nich-inklusiv), stddev mutt "
"positiv un Grött mutt grötter oder gliek 1 wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 231
#: xml_doc.cpp:5226
msgid "CONFIDENCE(alpha;stddev;size)"
msgstr "CONFIDENCE(alpha;stddev;Grött)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 232
#: xml_doc.cpp:5229
msgid "CONFIDENCE(0.05;1.5;100) equals 0.294059"
msgstr "CONFIDENCE(0,05;1,5;100) gifft \"0,294059\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 240
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 259
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 667
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 912
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1105
#: xml_doc.cpp:5232 xml_doc.cpp:5247 xml_doc.cpp:5605 xml_doc.cpp:5821
#: xml_doc.cpp:5995
msgid "Cell range of values"
msgstr "Zellrebeet vun Weerten"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 244
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 263
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 916
#: xml_doc.cpp:5235 xml_doc.cpp:5250 xml_doc.cpp:5824
msgid "Second cell range of values"
msgstr "Tweet Zellrebeet vun Weerten"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 248
#: xml_doc.cpp:5238
msgid ""
"The CORREL() function calculates the correlation coefficient of two cell "
"ranges."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CORREL() reekt den Korrelatschoonkoeffizient (Toorn-Biweert) "
"vun twee Zellrebeden ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 249
#: xml_doc.cpp:5241
msgid "CORREL(range1; range2)"
msgstr "CORREL(Rebeet1; Rebeet2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 250
#: xml_doc.cpp:5244
msgid "CORREL(A1:A3; B1:B3)"
msgstr "CORREL(A1:A3; B1:B3)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 267
#: xml_doc.cpp:5253
msgid "The COVAR() function calculates the covariance of two cell ranges."
msgstr "De Funkschoon COVAR() reekt de Kovarianz vun twee Zellrebeden ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 268
#: xml_doc.cpp:5256
msgid "COVAR(range1; range2)"
msgstr "COVAR(Rebeet1; Rebeet2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 269
#: xml_doc.cpp:5259
msgid "COVAR(A1:A3; B1:B3)"
msgstr "COVAR(A1:A3; B1:B3)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 297
#: xml_doc.cpp:5277
msgid "The DEVSQ() function calculates the sum of squares of deviations."
msgstr "De Funkschoon DEVSQ() reekt de Summ vun Quadraten vun Verschelen ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 298
#: xml_doc.cpp:5280
msgid "DEVSQ(value; value;...)"
msgstr "DEVSQ(Weert; Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 299
#: xml_doc.cpp:5283
msgid "DEVSQ(A1:A5)"
msgstr "DEVSQ(A1:A5)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 300
#: xml_doc.cpp:5286
msgid "DEVSQ(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 684.75"
msgstr "DEVSQ(21; 33; 54; 23) gifft \"684.75\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 312
#: xml_doc.cpp:5292
msgid "Lambda parameter"
msgstr "Lambda-Parameter"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 316
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 843
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 972
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1636
#: xml_doc.cpp:5295 xml_doc.cpp:5752 xml_doc.cpp:5872 xml_doc.cpp:6421
msgid "0 = density, 1 = distribution"
msgstr "0 = Dicht, 1 = Verdelen"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 320
#: xml_doc.cpp:5298
msgid "The EXPONDIST() function returns the exponential distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon EXPONDIST() gifft de exponentschell Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 321
#: xml_doc.cpp:5301
msgid "The lambda parameter must be positive."
msgstr "De Lambda-Parameter mutt positiv wesen."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 322
#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 978
#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1642
#: xml_doc.cpp:5304 xml_doc.cpp:5881 xml_doc.cpp:6430
msgid ""
"Cumulative = 0 calculates the density function; cumulative = 1 calculates "
"the distribution."
msgstr "Kumulativ = 0 reekt de Dicht-Funkschoon ut, kumulativ = 1 de Verdelen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 323
#: xml_doc.cpp:5307
msgid "EXPONDIST(number;lambda;cumulative)"
msgstr "EXPONDIST(Tall;lambda;kumulativ)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 324
#: xml_doc.cpp:5310
msgid "EXPONDIST(3;0.5;0) equals 0.111565"
msgstr "EXPONDIST(3;0,5;0) gifft \"0,111565\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 325
#: xml_doc.cpp:5313
msgid "EXPONDIST(3;0.5;1) equals 0.776870"
msgstr "EXPONDIST(3;0,5;1) gifft \"0,776870\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 337
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 689
#: xml_doc.cpp:5319 xml_doc.cpp:5623
msgid "Degrees of freedom 1"
msgstr "Freeheitgraad 1"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 341
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 693
#: xml_doc.cpp:5322 xml_doc.cpp:5626
msgid "Degrees of freedom 2"
msgstr "Freeheitgraad 2"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 345
#: xml_doc.cpp:5325
msgid "The FDIST() function returns the f-distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon FDIST() gifft de f-Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 346
#: xml_doc.cpp:5328
msgid "FDIST(number;degrees_freedom_1;degrees_freedom_2)"
msgstr "FDIST(Tall;Freeheitgraad_1;Freeheitgraad_2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 347
#: xml_doc.cpp:5331
msgid "FDIST(0.8;8;12) yields 0.61"
msgstr "FDIST(0,8;8;12) gifft \"0,61\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 359
#: xml_doc.cpp:5337
msgid "Number r1"
msgstr "Tall r1"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 363
#: xml_doc.cpp:5340
msgid "Number r2"
msgstr "Tall r2"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 367
#: xml_doc.cpp:5343
msgid ""
"The FINV() function returns the unique non-negative number x such that FDIST"
"(x;r1;r2) = p."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FINV() gifft de eenkennig nich-negativ Tall x torüch, so as "
"FDIST(x;r1;r2) = p."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 368
#: xml_doc.cpp:5346
msgid "FINV(number; r1; r2)"
msgstr "FINV(Tall; r1; r2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 369
#: xml_doc.cpp:5349
msgid "FDIST(FINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) equals 0.1"
msgstr "FDIST(FINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) gifft 0.1 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 381
#: xml_doc.cpp:5355
msgid ""
"The FISHER() function returns the Fisher transformation for x and creates a "
"function close to a normal distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FISHER() gifft de Fisher-Ümwanneln för x torüch un stellt en "
"Funkschoon liek en Normaalverdelen op."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 382
#: xml_doc.cpp:5358
msgid "FISHER(number)"
msgstr "FISHER(Tall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 383
#: xml_doc.cpp:5361
msgid "FISHER(0.2859) equals 0.294096"
msgstr "FISHER(0,2859) gifft \"0,294096\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 384
#: xml_doc.cpp:5364
msgid "FISHER(0.8105) equals 1.128485"
msgstr "FISHER(0,8105) gifft \"1,128485\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 396
#: xml_doc.cpp:5370
msgid ""
"The FISHERINV() function returns the inverse of the Fisher transformation "
"for x and creates a function close to a normal distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FISHERINV() gifft de Inverschoon vun de Fisher-Ümwanneln för x "
"torüch un stellt en Funkschoon liek en Normaalverdelen op."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 397
#: xml_doc.cpp:5373
msgid "FISHERINV(number)"
msgstr "FISHERINV(Tall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 398
#: xml_doc.cpp:5376
msgid "FISHERINV(0.2859) equals 0.278357"
msgstr "FISHERINV(0,2859) gifft \"0,278357\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 399
#: xml_doc.cpp:5379
msgid "FISHERINV(0.8105) equals 0.669866"
msgstr "FISHERINV(0,8105) gifft \"0,669866\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 407
#: xml_doc.cpp:5382
msgid "Floating point values, that should be counted."
msgstr "Fleetkommaweerten, de tellt warrn schöölt"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 411
#: xml_doc.cpp:5385
msgid ""
"Floating point values, representing the upper boundaries of the intervals."
msgstr "Fleetkommaweerten, de de Intervallen ehr Bövergrenzen dorstellt."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 415
#: xml_doc.cpp:5388
msgid ""
"Counts the number of values for each interval given by the border values in "
"the second parameter."
msgstr ""
"Tellt de Tall vun Weerten för elk dör de Grenzweerten vun den tweten "
"Parameter angeven Intervall."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 420
#: xml_doc.cpp:5391
msgid ""
"The values in the second parameter determine the upper boundaries of the "
"intervals.\n"
"                The intervals include the upper boundaries.\n"
"                The returned array is a column vector and has one more "
"element than the second parameter;\n"
"                the last element represents the number of all elements "
"greater than the last value in second parameter.\n"
"                If the second parameter is empty, all values in the first "
"parameter are counted."
msgstr ""
"De Weerten vun den tweten Parameter leggt de Bövergrenzen vun de Intervallen "
"fast.\n"
"                De Intervalls bargt de Bövergrenzen.\n"
"                Dat torüchgeven Feld is en Striepvektor un bargt een Element "
"mehr as de twete Parameter;\n"
"                dat leste Element gifft de Tall vun all Elementen an, de "
"grötter as de leste Weert vun den tweten Parameter sünd.\n"
"                Wenn de twete Parameter leddig is, warrt all Weerten vun den "
"eersten Parameter tellt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 421
#: xml_doc.cpp:5398
msgid "FREQUENCY(Range data; Range bins)"
msgstr "FREQUENCY(Rebeetdaten; Rebeetklassen)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 441
#: xml_doc.cpp:5410
msgid "Cumulated flag"
msgstr "Kumuleert (sammelt) Mark"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 445
#: xml_doc.cpp:5413
msgid "The GAMMADIST() function returns the gamma distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon GAMMADIST() gifft de Gamma-Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 446
#: xml_doc.cpp:5416
msgid ""
"If the last parameter (cumulated) is 0, it calculates the density function; "
"if it's 1, the distribution is returned."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de leste Parameter (kumuleert) \"0\" is, warrt de Dichtfunkschoon "
"utreekt, wenn he \"1\" is, warrt de Verdelen torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 447
#: xml_doc.cpp:5419
msgid "The first three parameters must be positive."
msgstr "De eersten dree Parameters mööt positiv wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 448
#: xml_doc.cpp:5422
msgid "GAMMADIST(number;alpha;beta;cumulated)"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(Tall;alpha;beta;sammelt)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 449
#: xml_doc.cpp:5425
msgid "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;1) equals 0.995450"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(0,758;0,1;0,35;1) gifft \"0,995450\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 450
#: xml_doc.cpp:5428
msgid "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;0) equals 0.017179"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(0,758;0,1;0,35;0) gifft \"0,017179\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 470
#: xml_doc.cpp:5440
msgid ""
"The GAMMAINV() function returns the unique number x >= 0 such that GAMMAINV"
"(x;alpha;beta;TRUE()) = p."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon GAMMAINV() gifft de eenkennig Tall x >= 0 torüch, so as "
"GAMMAINV(x;alpha;beta;TRUE()) = p."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 471
#: xml_doc.cpp:5443
msgid "GAMMAINV(number;alpha;beta)"
msgstr "GAMMAINV(Tall;alpha;beta)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 472
#: xml_doc.cpp:5446
msgid "GAMMADIST(GAMMAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) equals 0.1"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(GAMMAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) gifft 0.1 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 473
#: xml_doc.cpp:5449
msgid "GAMMADIST(GAMMAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) equals 0.3"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(GAMMAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) gifft 0.3 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 482
#: xml_doc.cpp:5452
msgid ""
"The number for which the integral value of standard normal distribution is "
"to be calculated"
msgstr ""
"De Tall, de ehr Integraalweert vun de Standardnormaalverdelen utreekt warrn "
"schall"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 486
#: xml_doc.cpp:5455
msgid ""
"The GAUSS() function returns the integral values for the standard normal "
"cumulative distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon GAUSS() gifft de Integraalweerten för de kumulativ "
"Standardnormaalverdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 487
#: xml_doc.cpp:5458
msgid "GAUSS(value)"
msgstr "GAUSS(Weert)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 488
#: xml_doc.cpp:5461
msgid "GAUSS(0.25) equals 0.098706"
msgstr "GAUSS(0,25) gifft \"0,098706\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 516
#: xml_doc.cpp:5479
msgid ""
"The GEOMEAN() function returns the geometric mean of the given arguments. "
"This is equal to the Nth root of the product of the terms."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon GEOMEAN() gifft den geometerschen Dörsnitt vun de angeven "
"Argumenten torüch. Dit is dat Sülve as de n-te Wörtel vun dat Produkt vun de "
"Weerten."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 517
#: xml_doc.cpp:5482
msgid "GEOMEAN(value; value;...)"
msgstr "GEOMEAN(Weert; Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 518
#: xml_doc.cpp:5485
msgid "GEOMEAN(A1:A5)"
msgstr "GEOMEAN(A1:A5)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 519
#: xml_doc.cpp:5488
msgid "GEOMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 30.45886"
msgstr "GEOMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) gifft \"30.45886\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 548
#: xml_doc.cpp:5506
msgid ""
"The HARMEAN() function returns the harmonic mean of the N data points (N "
"divided by the sum of the inverses of the data points)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon HARMEAN() gifft den harmoonsch Dörsnitt vun den N Datenpünkt "
"torüch (N deelt dör de Summ vun de Ümdreihfunkschonen vun de Datenpünkt)."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 549
#: xml_doc.cpp:5509
msgid "HARMEAN(value; value;...)"
msgstr "HARMEAN(Weert; Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 550
#: xml_doc.cpp:5512
msgid "HARMEAN(A1:A5)"
msgstr "HARMEAN(A1:A5)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 551
#: xml_doc.cpp:5515
msgid "HARMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 28.588"
msgstr "HARMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) gifft \"28.588\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 560
#: xml_doc.cpp:5518
msgid "Number of success in the sample"
msgstr "Tall vun Drepers in en Steekproov"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 564
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1714
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1755
#: xml_doc.cpp:5521 xml_doc.cpp:6466 xml_doc.cpp:6502
msgid "Number of trials"
msgstr "Tall vun Versöken"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 568
#: xml_doc.cpp:5524
msgid "Number of success overall"
msgstr "Tall vun Drepers tosamen"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 572
#: xml_doc.cpp:5527
msgid "Population size"
msgstr "Populatschoon-Grött"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 576
#: xml_doc.cpp:5530
msgid "The HYPGEOMDIST() function returns the hypergeometric distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon HYPGEOMDIST() gifft de hypergeometersch Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 577
#: xml_doc.cpp:5533
msgid "HYPGEOMDIST(x; n; M; N)"
msgstr "HYPGEOMDIST(x; n; M; N)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 578
#: xml_doc.cpp:5536
msgid "HYPGEOMDIST(2; 5; 6; 20) returns 0.3522"
msgstr "HYPGEOMDIST(2; 5; 6; 20) gifft \"0.3522\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 586
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1088
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1274
#: xml_doc.cpp:5539 xml_doc.cpp:5983 xml_doc.cpp:6133
msgid "y values (array)"
msgstr "Y-Weerten (Feld)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 590
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1092
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1278
#: xml_doc.cpp:5542 xml_doc.cpp:5986 xml_doc.cpp:6136
msgid "x values (array)"
msgstr "X-Weerten (Feld)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 594
#: xml_doc.cpp:5545
msgid ""
"The INTERCEPT() function calculates the interception of the linear "
"regression line with the y axis."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon INTERCEPT() reekt den Snittpunkt vun de lineaar Regreschoon "
"mit de y-Ass ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 595
#: xml_doc.cpp:5548
msgid "INTERCEPT(y;x)"
msgstr "INTERCEPT(y;x)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 623
#: xml_doc.cpp:5566
msgid ""
"The KURT() function calculates an unbiased estimate of the kurtosis of a "
"data set. You have to provide at least 4 values, otherwise an error is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon KURT() reekt en verwacht Vermoden vun en Datensett sien Timp "
"(Kurtosis) ut. Tominnst veer Weerten mööt angeven wesen, anners warrt en "
"Fehler torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 624
#: xml_doc.cpp:5569
msgid "KURT(value; value;...)"
msgstr "KURT(Weert; Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 625
#: xml_doc.cpp:5572
msgid "KURT(A1:A5)"
msgstr "KURT(A1:A5)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 626
#: xml_doc.cpp:5575
msgid "KURT(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 1.344239"
msgstr "KURT(21; 33; 54; 23) gifft \"1.344239\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 655
#: xml_doc.cpp:5593
msgid ""
"The KURTP() function calculates an population kurtosis of a data set. You "
"have to provide at least 4 values, otherwise an error is returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon KURTP() reekt en Populatschoon-Timp vun en Datensett ut. Warrt "
"weniger as veer Weerten angeven, denn warrt en Fehler torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 656
#: xml_doc.cpp:5596
msgid "KURTP(value; value;...)"
msgstr "KURTP(Weert; Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 657
#: xml_doc.cpp:5599
msgid "KURTP(A1:A5)"
msgstr "KURTP(A1:A5)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 658
#: xml_doc.cpp:5602
msgid "KURTP(21; 33; 54; 23) returns -1.021"
msgstr "KURTP(21; 33; 54; 23) gifft \"-1.021\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 671
#: xml_doc.cpp:5608
msgid "Position (from the largest)"
msgstr "Positschoon (vun den gröttsten)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 675
#: xml_doc.cpp:5611
msgid "The LARGE() function returns the k-th largest value from the data set."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon LARGE() gifft en Datensett sien k-ten gröttsten Weert torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 676
#: xml_doc.cpp:5614
msgid "LARGE(range; k)"
msgstr "LARGE(Rebeet; k)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 677
#: xml_doc.cpp:5617
msgid "A1: 3, A2: 1, A3: 5 => LARGE(A1:A3; 2) returns 3"
msgstr "A1: 3, A2: 1, A3: 5 => LARGE(A1:A3; 2) gifft \"3\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 697
#: xml_doc.cpp:5629
msgid "The LEGACYFDIST() function returns the f-distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon LEGACYFDIST() gifft de f-Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 698
#: xml_doc.cpp:5632
msgid "LEGACYFDIST(number;degrees_freedom_1;degrees_freedom_2)"
msgstr "LEGACYFDIST(Tall;Freeheitgraad_1;Freeheitgraad_2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 699
#: xml_doc.cpp:5635
msgid "LEGACYFDIST(0.8;8;12) yields 0.61"
msgstr "LEGACYFDIST(0.8;8;12) gifft 0,61"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 707
#: xml_doc.cpp:5638
msgid "Probability"
msgstr "Wohrschienlichkeit"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 711
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 733
#: xml_doc.cpp:5641 xml_doc.cpp:5659
msgid "Mean value of the standard logarithmic distribution"
msgstr "Middelweert vun de logaritmisch Standardverdelen"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 715
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 737
#: xml_doc.cpp:5644 xml_doc.cpp:5662
msgid "Standard deviation of the standard logarithmic distribution"
msgstr "Standardverscheel vun de logaritmisch Standardverdelen"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 719
#: xml_doc.cpp:5647
msgid ""
"The LOGINV() function returns the inverse of the lognormal cumulative "
"distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon LOGINV() gifft de ümdreiht logaritmisch Standardverdelen "
"torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 720
#: xml_doc.cpp:5650
msgid "LOGINV(p; mean; stdev)"
msgstr "LOGINV(p; middelweert; standardverdelen)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 721
#: xml_doc.cpp:5653
msgid "LOGINV(0.1;0;1) equals 0.2776"
msgstr "LOGINV(0.1;0;1) gifft \"0.2776\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 729
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 862
#: xml_doc.cpp:5656 xml_doc.cpp:5779
msgid ""
"Probability value for which the standard logarithmic distribution is to be "
"calculated"
msgstr ""
"Wohrschienlichkeitweert, för den de logaritmisch Standardverdelen utreekt "
"warrn schall"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 741
#: xml_doc.cpp:5665
msgid ""
"The LOGNORMDIST() function returns the cumulative lognormal distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon LOGNORMDIST() gifft de kumulativ logaritmisch Standardverdelen "
"torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 742
#: xml_doc.cpp:5668
msgid "LOGNORMDIST(Number;MV;STD)"
msgstr "LOGNORMDIST(Tall;MV;STD)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 743
#: xml_doc.cpp:5671
msgid "LOGNORMDIST(0.1;0;1) equals 0.01"
msgstr "LOGNORMDIST(0,1;0;1) gifft \"0,01\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 751
#: xml_doc.cpp:5674
msgid "Floating point value or range of values"
msgstr "Fleetkommaweert oder Weertrebeet"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 755
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 759
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 763
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 767
#: xml_doc.cpp:5677 xml_doc.cpp:5680 xml_doc.cpp:5683 xml_doc.cpp:5686
msgid "Floating point values or range of values"
msgstr "Fleetkommaweerten oder Weertrebeet"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 771
#: xml_doc.cpp:5689
msgid ""
"The MEDIAN() function calculates the median of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the median of a range like MEDIAN(A1:B5) or a "
"list of values like MEDIAN(12; 5; 12.5). Blank cells will be considered as a "
"zero, and cells with text will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MEDIAN() reekt den Zentraalweert (Median) vun all as "
"Parameters angeven Weerten ut. Een kann den Median vun en Rebeet MEDIAN(A1:"
"B5) oder en List vun Weerten liek MEDIAN(12;5;12.5) utreken. Leddig Zellen "
"warrt as Null vermoodt un Zellen de Text bargt warrt övergahn."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 772
#: xml_doc.cpp:5692
msgid "MEDIAN(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MEDIAN(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 773
#: xml_doc.cpp:5695
msgid "MEDIAN(12; 5; 5.5) equals 5.5"
msgstr "MEDIAN(12; 5; 5,5) gifft \"5.5\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 774
#: xml_doc.cpp:5698
msgid "MEDIAN(12; 7; 8;2) equals 7.5"
msgstr "MEDIAN(12; 7; 8;2) gifft \"7,5\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 782
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 786
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 790
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 794
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1032
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1036
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1040
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1044
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1060
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1064
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1068
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1072
#: xml_doc.cpp:5701 xml_doc.cpp:5704 xml_doc.cpp:5707 xml_doc.cpp:5710
#: xml_doc.cpp:5935 xml_doc.cpp:5938 xml_doc.cpp:5941 xml_doc.cpp:5944
#: xml_doc.cpp:5959 xml_doc.cpp:5962 xml_doc.cpp:5965 xml_doc.cpp:5968
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Fleetkomma"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 798
#: xml_doc.cpp:5713
msgid ""
"The MODE() function returns the most frequently occuring value in the data "
"set."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MODE() gifft den tomehrst vörkamen Weert binnen en Datensett "
"torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 799
#: xml_doc.cpp:5716
msgid "MODE(number; number2; ...)"
msgstr "MODE(Tall; Tall2; ...)"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 800
#: xml_doc.cpp:5719
msgid "MODE(range)"
msgstr "MODE(Rebeet)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 801
#: xml_doc.cpp:5722
msgid "MODE(12; 14; 12; 15) returns 12"
msgstr "MODE(12; 14; 12; 15) gifft \"12\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 809
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1759
#: xml_doc.cpp:5725 xml_doc.cpp:6505
msgid "Number of failures"
msgstr "Fehlertall"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 813
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1718
#: xml_doc.cpp:5728 xml_doc.cpp:6469
msgid "Number of successful trials"
msgstr "Tall vun glückt Versöken"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 817
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1722
#: xml_doc.cpp:5731 xml_doc.cpp:6472
msgid "Probability of success"
msgstr "Dreperwohrschienlichkeit"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 821
#: xml_doc.cpp:5734
msgid "The NEGBINOMDIST() function returns the negative binomial distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon NEGBINOMDIST() gifft de negative binoomsch Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 822
#: xml_doc.cpp:5737
msgid "NEGBINOMDIST(failures; success; prob_of_success)"
msgstr "NEGBINOMDIST(Fehlers; Drepers; Dreperwohrschienlichkeit)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 823
#: xml_doc.cpp:5740
msgid "NEGBINOMDIST(2;5;0.55) returns 0.152872629"
msgstr "NEGBINOMDIST(2;5;0.55) gifft \"0.152872629\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 835
#: xml_doc.cpp:5746
msgid "Linear middle of the distribution"
msgstr "De Verdelen ehr lineaar Middelweert"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 839
#: xml_doc.cpp:5749
msgid "Standard deviation of the distribution"
msgstr "De Verdelen ehr Standardverscheel"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 847
#: xml_doc.cpp:5755
msgid "The NORMDIST() function returns the normal cumulative distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon NORMDIST() gifft de kumulativ Normaalverdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 848
#: xml_doc.cpp:5758
msgid ""
"Number is the value of the distribution based on which the normal "
"distribution is to be calculated."
msgstr ""
"\"Tall\" is de Weert vun de Verdelen, op den dat Utreken för de "
"Normaalverdelen opbuut."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 849
#: xml_doc.cpp:5761
msgid "MV is the linear middle of the distribution."
msgstr "MV is de Verdelen ehr lineaar Middelweert."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 850
#: xml_doc.cpp:5764
msgid "STD is the standard deviation of the distribution."
msgstr "STD is de Verdelen ehr Standardverscheel."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 851
#: xml_doc.cpp:5767
msgid ""
"K = 0 calculates the density function; K = 1 calculates the distribution."
msgstr "K = 0 reekt de Dichtfunkschoon ut, K = 1 de Verdelen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 852
#: xml_doc.cpp:5770
msgid "NORMDIST(Number;MV;STD;K)"
msgstr "NORMDIST(Tall;MV;STD;K)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 853
#: xml_doc.cpp:5773
msgid "NORMDIST(0.859;0.6;0.258;0) equals 0.934236"
msgstr "NORMDIST(0,859;0,6;0,258;0) gifft \"0,934236\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 854
#: xml_doc.cpp:5776
msgid "NORMDIST(0.859;0.6;0.258;1) equals 0.842281"
msgstr "NORMDIST(0,859;0,6;0,258;1) gifft \"0,842281\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 866
#: xml_doc.cpp:5782
msgid "Middle value in the normal distribution"
msgstr "Middelweert binnen de Normaalverdelen"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 870
#: xml_doc.cpp:5785
msgid "Standard deviation of the normal distribution"
msgstr "Standardverscheel vun de Normaalverdelen"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 874
#: xml_doc.cpp:5788
msgid ""
"The NORMINV() function returns the inverse of the normal cumulative "
"distribution. The number must be between 0 and 1 (non-inclusive) and STD "
"must be positive."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon NORMINV() gifft de Inverschoon (Ümdreihen) vun de kumulativ "
"Normaalverdelen torüch. De Tall mutt twischen 0 un 1 wesen (nich-inklusiv) "
"un STD mutt positiv wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 875
#: xml_doc.cpp:5791
msgid "NORMINV(number;MV;STD)"
msgstr "NORMINV(Tall;MV;STD)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 876
#: xml_doc.cpp:5794
msgid "NORMINV(0.9;63;5) equals 69.41"
msgstr "NORMINV(0,9;63;5) gifft \"69,41\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 884
#: xml_doc.cpp:5797
msgid "Value to which the standard normal distribution is calculated"
msgstr "Weert, för den de Standard-Normaalverdelen utreekt warrt"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 888
#: xml_doc.cpp:5800
msgid "The NORMSDIST() function returns the standard normal distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon NORMSDIST() gifft de Standard-Normaalverdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 889
#: xml_doc.cpp:5803
msgid "NORMSDIST(Number)"
msgstr "NORMSDIST(Tall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 890
#: xml_doc.cpp:5806
msgid "NORMSDIST(1) equals 0.84"
msgstr "NORMSDIST(1) gifft \"0,84\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 902
#: xml_doc.cpp:5812
msgid ""
"The NORMSINV() function returns the inverse of the standard normal "
"cumulative distribution. The number must be between 0 and 1 (non-inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon NORMSINV() gifft de Inverschoon (Ümdreihen) vun de kumulativ "
"Standardnormaalverdelen torüch. De Tall mutt twischen 0 un 1 wesen (nich-"
"inklusiv)."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 903
#: xml_doc.cpp:5815
msgid "NORMSINV(Number)"
msgstr "NORMSINV(Tall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 904
#: xml_doc.cpp:5818
msgid "NORMSINV(0.908789) returns 1.3333"
msgstr "NORMSINV(0,908789) gifft \"1,3333\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 920
#: xml_doc.cpp:5827
msgid ""
"The PEARSON() function calculates the correlation coefficient of two cell "
"ranges. It is the same as the CORREL function."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PEARSON() reekt den Korrelatschoonkoeffizient vun twee "
"Zellrebeden ut. Dit is dat Sülvige as de Funkschoon \"CORREL\"."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 921
#: xml_doc.cpp:5830
msgid "PEARSON(range1; range2)"
msgstr "PEARSON(Rebeet1; Rebeet2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 922
#: xml_doc.cpp:5833
msgid "PEARSON(A1:A3; B1:B3)"
msgstr "PEARSON(A1:A3; B1:B3)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 935
#: xml_doc.cpp:5839
msgid "Number of elements to permutate"
msgstr "Tall vun Elementen för't Permuteren"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 939
#: xml_doc.cpp:5842
msgid ""
"The PERMUT() function returns the number of permutations. The first "
"parameter is the number of elements, and the second parameter is the number "
"of elements used in the permutation."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PERMUT() gifft de Tall vun Permutatschonen (Ännern) torüch. De "
"eerste Parameter is de Tall vun Elementen, de twete de Tall vun Elementen "
"för de Permutatschoon."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 940
#: xml_doc.cpp:5845
msgid "PERMUT(total;permutated)"
msgstr "PERMUT(tosamen;bruukt)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 941
#: xml_doc.cpp:5848
msgid "PERMUT(8;5) equals 6720"
msgstr "PERMUT(8;5) gifft \"6720\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 942
#: xml_doc.cpp:5851
msgid "PERMUT(1;1) equals 1"
msgstr "PERMUT(1;1) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 950
#: xml_doc.cpp:5854
msgid ""
"The number for which the standard normal distribution is to be calculated"
msgstr "De Tall, de ehr Standard-Normaalverdelen utreekt warrn schall"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 954
#: xml_doc.cpp:5857
msgid ""
"The PHI() function returns value of the distribution function for a standard "
"normal distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PHI() gifft den Weert vun de Verdelenfunkschoon för en "
"Standard-Normaalverdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 955
#: xml_doc.cpp:5860
msgid "PHI(value)"
msgstr "PHI(Weert)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 956
#: xml_doc.cpp:5863
msgid "PHI(0.25) equals 0.386668"
msgstr "PHI(0,25) gifft \"0,386668\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 968
#: xml_doc.cpp:5869
msgid "Lambda parameter (the middle value)"
msgstr "Lambda-Parameter (Middelweert)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 976
#: xml_doc.cpp:5875
msgid "The POISSON() function returns the Poisson distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon POISSON() gifft de Poisson-Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 977
#: xml_doc.cpp:5878
msgid "The lambda and number parameters must be positive."
msgstr "Parameters vun \"Lambda\" un \"Tall\" mööt positiv wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 979
#: xml_doc.cpp:5884
msgid "POISSON(number;lambda;cumulative)"
msgstr "POISSON(Tall;lambda;kumulativ)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 980
#: xml_doc.cpp:5887
msgid "POISSON(60;50;0) equals 0.020105"
msgstr "POISSON(60;50;0) gifft \"0,020105\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 981
#: xml_doc.cpp:5890
msgid "POISSON(60;50;1) equals 0.927840"
msgstr "POISSON(60;50;1) gifft \"0,927840\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 993
#: xml_doc.cpp:5896
msgid "Data (array)"
msgstr "Daten (Feld)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 997
#: xml_doc.cpp:5899
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Reeg"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1001
#: xml_doc.cpp:5902
msgid "The RANK() function returns the rank of a number in a list of numbers."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon RANK() gifft en Tall ehr Rang binnen en List vun Tallen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1002
#: xml_doc.cpp:5905
msgid "Order specifies how to rank the numbers:"
msgstr "Reeg gifft an, wodennig de Tallen inreegt warrt."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1003
#: xml_doc.cpp:5908
msgid "If 0 or omitted, Data is ranked in descending order."
msgstr "Wenn \"0\" oder utlaten, denn warrt de Daten daalwarts sorteert."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1004
#: xml_doc.cpp:5911
msgid "If not 0, Data is ranked in descending order."
msgstr "Wenn nich \"0\", denn warrt de Daten daalwarts sorteert."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1005
#: xml_doc.cpp:5914
msgid "RSQ(Value; Data; Order)"
msgstr "RSQ (Weert, Daten, Reeg)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1006
#: xml_doc.cpp:5917
msgid "RANK (2;{1;2;3}) equals 2"
msgstr "RANK (2;{1;2;3}) gifft 2 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1014
#: xml_doc.cpp:5920
msgid "known Y (array)"
msgstr "Begäng Y (Feld)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1018
#: xml_doc.cpp:5923
msgid "known X (array)"
msgstr "Begäng X (Feld)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1022
#: xml_doc.cpp:5926
msgid ""
"The RSQ() function returns the square of the Pearson product moment "
"correlation coefficient through data points in known_y's and known_x's."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon RSQ() gifft dat Quadraat vun den Korrelatschoonkoeffizient dör "
"twee Datenpünkt in begäng_x'en un begäng_y's an."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1023
#: xml_doc.cpp:5929
msgid ""
"If \"arrayY\" and \"arrayX\" are empty or have a different number of data "
"points, then #N/A is returned."
msgstr ""
"Wenn \"FeldY\" un \"FeldX\" leddig sünd oder en anner Tall vun Datenpünkt "
"bargt, dennwarrt \"n.v.\" torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1024
#: xml_doc.cpp:5932
msgid "RSQ(known Y; known X)"
msgstr "RSQ(begäng Y; begäng X)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1048
#: xml_doc.cpp:5947
msgid "The SKEW() function returns an estimate for skewness of a distribution"
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SKEW() gifft de vermoodt Populatschoonkippen vun en Verdelen "
"torüch"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1049
#: xml_doc.cpp:5950
msgid "SKEW(number; number2; ...)"
msgstr "SKEW(Tall1; Tall2; ...)"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1050
#: xml_doc.cpp:5953
msgid "SKEW(range)"
msgstr "SKEW(Rebeet)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1051
#: xml_doc.cpp:5956
msgid "SKEW(11.4; 17.3; 21.3; 25.9; 40.1) returns 0.9768"
msgstr "SKEW(11.4; 17.3; 21.3; 25.9; 40.1) gifft \"0.9768\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1076
#: xml_doc.cpp:5971
msgid "The SKEWP() function returns the population skewness of a distribution"
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SKEWP() gifft de Populatschoonkippen vun en Verdelen torüch"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1077
#: xml_doc.cpp:5974
msgid "SKEWP(number; number2; ...)"
msgstr "SKEWP(Tall; Tall2; ...)"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1078
#: xml_doc.cpp:5977
msgid "SKEWP(range)"
msgstr "SKEWP(Rebeet)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1079
#: xml_doc.cpp:5980
msgid "SKEWP(11.4; 17.3; 21.3; 25.9; 40.1) returns 0.6552"
msgstr "SKEWP(11.4; 17.3; 21.3; 25.9; 40.1) gifft \"0.6552\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1096
#: xml_doc.cpp:5989
msgid ""
"The SLOPE() function calculates the slope of the linear regression line."
msgstr "De Funkschoon SLOPE() reekt de lineaar Regreschoonlien ehr Steigen ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1097
#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1283
#: xml_doc.cpp:5992 xml_doc.cpp:6142
msgid "SLOPE(y;x)"
msgstr "SLOPE(y;x)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1109
#: xml_doc.cpp:5998
msgid "Position (from the smallest)"
msgstr "Positschoon (vun den lüttsten)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1113
#: xml_doc.cpp:6001
msgid "The SMALL() function returns the k-th smallest value from the data set."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SMALL() gifft en Datensett sien k-ten lüttsten Weert torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1114
#: xml_doc.cpp:6004
msgid "SMALL(range; k)"
msgstr "SMALL(Rebeet; k)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1115
#: xml_doc.cpp:6007
msgid "A1: 3, A2: 1, A3: 5 => SMALL(A1:A3; 1) returns 1"
msgstr "A1: 3, A2: 1, A3: 5 => SMALL(A1:A3; 1) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1123
#: xml_doc.cpp:6010
msgid "Number to be normalized"
msgstr "Tall för't Normaliseren"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1127
#: xml_doc.cpp:6013
msgid "Mean of the distribution"
msgstr "Middelweert vun de Verdelen"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1131
#: xml_doc.cpp:6016
msgid "Standard deviation"
msgstr "Standardverscheel"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1135
#: xml_doc.cpp:6019
msgid "The STANDARDIZE() function calculates a normalized value."
msgstr "De Funkschoon STANDARDIZE() reekt en liekmaakt Weert ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1136
#: xml_doc.cpp:6022
msgid "STANDARDIZE(x; mean, stdev)"
msgstr "STANDARDIZE(x; Middel, Standardverscheel)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1137
#: xml_doc.cpp:6025
msgid "STANDARDIZE(4; 3; 7) returns 0.1429"
msgstr "STANDARDIZE(4; 3; 7) gifft \"0.1429\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1165
#: xml_doc.cpp:6043
msgid ""
"The STDEV() function returns the estimate standard deviation based on a "
"sample. The standard deviation is a measure of how widely values are "
"dispersed from the average value."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon STDEV() gifft den vermoodt Standardverscheel baseert op en "
"Steekproov torüch. De Standardverscheel is en Maat för de Streuen vun den "
"Dörsnittweert."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1166
#: xml_doc.cpp:6046
msgid "STDEV(value;value;...)"
msgstr "STDEV(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1167
#: xml_doc.cpp:6049
msgid "STDEV(6;7;8) equals 1"
msgstr "STDEV(6;7;8) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1196
#: xml_doc.cpp:6067
msgid ""
"The STDEVA() function returns the estimate standard deviation based on a "
"sample. The standard deviation is a measure of how widely values are "
"dispersed from the average value. If a referenced cell contains text or "
"contains the boolean value FALSE, it is counted as 0. If the boolean value "
"is TRUE it is counted as 1."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon STDEVA() gifft den vermoodt Standardverscheel baseert op en "
"Steekproov ut. De Standardverscheel is en Maat för de Streuen vun den "
"Dörsnittweert. Wenn en angeven Zell Text oder den boolsch Weert \"falsch\" "
"bargt, warrt se as 0 tellt, un as 1, wenn de boolsch Weert \"wohr\" is."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1197
#: xml_doc.cpp:6070
msgid "STDEVA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "STDEVA(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1198
#: xml_doc.cpp:6073
msgid "STDEVA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 1, if A1 is empty"
msgstr "STDEVA(6; 7; A1; 8) gifft \"1\" torüch, wenn A1 leddig is"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1199
#: xml_doc.cpp:6076
msgid "STDEVA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 3.109, if A1 is TRUE"
msgstr "STDEVA(6; 7; A1; 8) gifft \"3,109\" torüch, wenn A1 wohr is"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1229
#: xml_doc.cpp:6094
msgid ""
"The STDEVP() function returns the standard deviation based on an entire "
"population"
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon STDEVP() reekt den Standardverscheel baseert op en heel "
"statistisch Koppel ut"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1230
#: xml_doc.cpp:6097
msgid "STDEVP(value;value;...)"
msgstr "STDEVP(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1231
#: xml_doc.cpp:6100
msgid "STDEVP(6;7;8) equals 0.816497..."
msgstr "STDEVP(6;7;8) gifft \"0.816497...\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1260
#: xml_doc.cpp:6118
msgid ""
"The STDEVPA() function returns standard deviation based on an entire "
"population. If a referenced cell contains text or contains the boolean value "
"FALSE, it is counted as 0. If the boolean value is TRUE it is counted as 1."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon STDEVPA() reekt den Standardverscheel baseert op en heel "
"statistisch Koppel ut. Wenn en angeven Zell Text oder den boolsch Weert "
"\"falsch\" bargt, warrt se as \"0\" tellt. Wenn de boolsch Weert \"wohr\" is "
"warrt se as \"1\" tellt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1261
#: xml_doc.cpp:6121
msgid "STDEVPA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "STDEVPA(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1262
#: xml_doc.cpp:6124
msgid "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 0.816497..., if A1 is empty"
msgstr "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) gifft \"0.816497...\" torüch, wenn A1 leddig is"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1263
#: xml_doc.cpp:6127
msgid "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 2.69..., if A1 is TRUE"
msgstr "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) gifft \"2.69...\" torüch, wenn A1 wohr is"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1264
#: xml_doc.cpp:6130
msgid "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 3.11..., if A1 is FALSE"
msgstr "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) gifft \"3.11...\" torüch, wenn A1 falsch is"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1282
#: xml_doc.cpp:6139
msgid ""
"The STEYX() function calculates the standard error of the predicted y value "
"for each x in the regression."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon STEYX() reekt den Standardfehler vun den verwacht y-Weert för "
"elk x binnen de Regreschoon ut."

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1296
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1300
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1314
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1318
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1332
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1336
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1737
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1741
#: xml_doc.cpp:6145 xml_doc.cpp:6148 xml_doc.cpp:6160 xml_doc.cpp:6163
#: xml_doc.cpp:6175 xml_doc.cpp:6178 xml_doc.cpp:6487 xml_doc.cpp:6490
msgid "Value (array)"
msgstr "Weert (Feld)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1304
#: xml_doc.cpp:6151
msgid ""
"The SUMPRODUCT() function (SUM(X*Y)) returns the sum of the product of these "
"values. The number of values in the two arrays should be equal. Otherwise "
"this function returns Err."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SUMPRODUCT() (SUM(X*Y)) gifft de Summ vun dat Produkt vun "
"disse Weerten torüch. De Tall vun Weerten binnen de twee Feller schall liek "
"wesen. Anners gifft disse Funkschoon \"Err\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1305
#: xml_doc.cpp:6154
msgid "SUMPRODUCT(array1;array2)"
msgstr "SUMPRODUCT(Feld1;Feld2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1306
#: xml_doc.cpp:6157
msgid "SUMPRODUCT(A1:A2;B1:B2) with A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 and B2=5, returns 31"
msgstr "SUMPRODUCT(A1:A2;B1:B2) mit A1=2 A2=5 B1=3 un B2=5 gifft \"31\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1322
#: xml_doc.cpp:6166
msgid ""
"The SUMX2PY2() function (SUM(X^2+Y^2)) returns the sum of the squares of "
"these values. The number of values in the two arrays should be equal. "
"Otherwise this function returns Err."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SUMX2PY2() (SUM(X^2+Y^2)) gifft de Sum vun de Quadraten vun "
"dissen Weerten torüch. De Tall vun Weerten binnen de twee Feller schall liek "
"wesen. Anners gifft disse Funkschoon \"Err\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1323
#: xml_doc.cpp:6169
msgid "SUMX2PY2(array1;array2)"
msgstr "SUMX2PY2(Feld1;Feld2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1324
#: xml_doc.cpp:6172
msgid "SUMX2PY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) with A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 and B2=5, returns 63"
msgstr "SUMX2PY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) mit A1=2 A2=5 B1=3 un B2=5 gifft \"63\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1340
#: xml_doc.cpp:6181
msgid ""
"The SUMX2MY2() function (SUM(X^2-Y^2)) returns the difference of the squares "
"of these values. The number of values in the two arrays should be equal. "
"Otherwise this function returns Err."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SUMX2MY2() (SUM(X^2-Y^2)) gifft den Verscheel vun de Quadraten "
"vun disse Weerten torüch. De Tall vun Weerten binnen de twee Feller schall "
"liek wesen. Anners gifft disse Funkschoon \"Err\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1341
#: xml_doc.cpp:6184
msgid "SUMX2MY2(array1;array2)"
msgstr "SUMX2MY2(Feld1;Feld2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1342
#: xml_doc.cpp:6187
msgid "SUMX2MY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) with A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 and B2=5, returns -5"
msgstr "SUMX2MY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) mit A1=2 A2=5 B1=3 un B2=5 gifft \"-5\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1354
#: xml_doc.cpp:6193
msgid "Degrees of freedom for the t-distribution"
msgstr "Freeheitgraad för de t-Verdelen"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1358
#: xml_doc.cpp:6196
msgid "Mode (1 or 2)"
msgstr "Metood (1 oder 2)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1362
#: xml_doc.cpp:6199
msgid "The TDIST() function returns the t-distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon TDIST() gifft de t-Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1363
#: xml_doc.cpp:6202
msgid ""
"Mode = 1 returns the one-tailed test, Mode = 2 returns the two-tailed test."
msgstr ""
"Metood = 1 gifft den eensiedigen Test torüch, Metood = 2 den tweesiedigen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1364
#: xml_doc.cpp:6205
msgid "TDIST(number;degrees_freedom;mode)"
msgstr "TDIST(Tall;Freeheitgraad;Metood)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1365
#: xml_doc.cpp:6208
msgid "TDIST(12;5;1) returns 0.000035"
msgstr "TDIST(12;5;1) gifft \"0,000035\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1373
#: xml_doc.cpp:6211
msgid "KnownY"
msgstr "Begäng Y"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1377
#: xml_doc.cpp:6214
msgid "KnownX"
msgstr "Begäng X"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1381
#: xml_doc.cpp:6217
msgid "NumberSequence newX"
msgstr "Tallenreeg niegX"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1385
#: xml_doc.cpp:6220
msgid "allowOffset"
msgstr "Versatz_tolaten"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1389
#: xml_doc.cpp:6223
msgid ""
"The TREND() function calculates a sequence of values based on a linear "
"regression of known value pairs."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TREND() reekt en Reeg vun Weerten ut, de op en lineaar "
"Regreschoon vun begäng Weertporen baseert."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1390
#: xml_doc.cpp:6226
msgid "Constraints: COUNT(knownY) = COUNT(knownX)."
msgstr "Bedingen: COUNT(begängY) = COUNT(begängX)."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1391
#: xml_doc.cpp:6229
msgid "TREND(knownY[;knownX[;newX[;allowOffset = TRUE]]])"
msgstr "TREND(begängY[;begängX[;niegX[;Versatz_tolaten = WOHR]]])"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1402
#: xml_doc.cpp:6232
msgid "dataSet"
msgstr "Datensett"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1406
#: xml_doc.cpp:6235
msgid "cutOffFraction"
msgstr "Grenzandeel"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1410
#: xml_doc.cpp:6238
msgid "The TRIMMEAN() function calculates the mean of a data set's fraction."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TRIMMEAN() reekt den Middelweert vun en Datensettandeel ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1411
#: xml_doc.cpp:6241
msgid "TRIMMEAN(dataSet; cutOffFraction)"
msgstr "TRIMMEAN(Datensett; Grenzandeel)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1422
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1653
#: xml_doc.cpp:6244 xml_doc.cpp:6442
msgid "x (array)"
msgstr "x (Feld)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1426
#: xml_doc.cpp:6247
msgid "y (array)"
msgstr "y (Feld)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1434
#: xml_doc.cpp:6253
msgid "mode"
msgstr "Metood"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1438
#: xml_doc.cpp:6256
msgid "The TTEST() function calculates the probability of a t-test."
msgstr "De Funkschoon TTEST() reekt de Wohrschienlichkeit vun en t-Test ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1439
#: xml_doc.cpp:6259
msgid "TTEST(x; y; type; mode)"
msgstr "TTEST(x; y; Typ; Metood)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1467
#: xml_doc.cpp:6277
msgid "The VAR() function calculates the estimates variance based on a sample."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon VAR() reekt de vermoodt Varianz ut, baseert op en Stickproov."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1468
#: xml_doc.cpp:6280
msgid "VAR(value;value;...)"
msgstr "VAR(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1469
#: xml_doc.cpp:6283
msgid "VAR(12;5;7) equals 13"
msgstr "VAR(12;5;7) gifft \"13\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1470
#: xml_doc.cpp:6286
msgid "VAR(15;80;3) equals 1716.333..."
msgstr "VAR(15;80;3) gifft \"1716.333...\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1471
#: xml_doc.cpp:6289
msgid "VAR(6;7;8) equals 1"
msgstr "VAR(6;7;8) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1503
#: xml_doc.cpp:6307
msgid "The VARA() function calculates the variance based on a sample."
msgstr "De Funkschoon VARA() reekt de Varianz ut, baseert op en Steekproov."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1504
#: xml_doc.cpp:6310
msgid "VARA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "VARA(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1505
#: xml_doc.cpp:6313
msgid "VARA(12;5;7) equals 13"
msgstr "VARA(12;5;7) gifft \"13\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1506
#: xml_doc.cpp:6316
msgid "VARA(15;80;3) equals 1716.333..."
msgstr "VARA(15;80;3) gifft \"1716.333...\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1507
#: xml_doc.cpp:6319
msgid "VARA(6;7;8) equals 1"
msgstr "VARA(6;7;8) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1538
#: xml_doc.cpp:6337
msgid ""
"The VARIANCE() function calculates the estimates variance based on a sample. "
"It's the same as the VAR function."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon VARIANCE() reekt de vermoodt Varianz ut, baseert op en "
"Steekproov. Dat is dat Sülvige as de Funkschoon \"VAR\"."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1539
#: xml_doc.cpp:6340
msgid "VARIANCE(value;value;...)"
msgstr "VARIANCE(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1540
#: xml_doc.cpp:6343
msgid "VARIANCE(12;5;7) equals 13"
msgstr "VARIANCE(12;5;7) gifft \"13\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1541
#: xml_doc.cpp:6346
msgid "VARIANCE(15;80;3) equals 1716.333..."
msgstr "VARIANCE(15;80;3) gifft \"1716.333...\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1542
#: xml_doc.cpp:6349
msgid "VARIANCE(6;7;8) equals 1"
msgstr "VARIANCE(6;7;8) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1574
#: xml_doc.cpp:6367
msgid ""
"The VARP() function calculates the variance based on an entire population."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon VARP() reekt de Varianz baseert op en heel statistisch Koppel "
"ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1575
#: xml_doc.cpp:6370
msgid "VARP(value;value;...)"
msgstr "VARP(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1576
#: xml_doc.cpp:6373
msgid "VARP(12;5;7) equals 8.666..."
msgstr "VARP(12;5;7) gifft \"8.666...\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1577
#: xml_doc.cpp:6376
msgid "VARP(15;80;3) equals 1144.22..."
msgstr "VARP(15;80;3) gifft \"1144.22...\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1578
#: xml_doc.cpp:6379
msgid "VARP(6;7;8) equals 0.6666667..."
msgstr "VARP(6;7;8) gifft 0.6666667... torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1609
#: xml_doc.cpp:6397
msgid ""
"The VARPA() function calculates the variance based on an entire population. "
"Text and boolean values that evaluate to FALSE are counted as 0, boolean "
"value that evaluate to TRUE are counted as 1."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon VARPA() reekt de Varianz baseert op en heel Populatschoon ut. "
"Text un boolsch Weerten mit Resultaat \"falsch\" warrt as 0 tellt un boolsch "
"Weerten mit Resultaat \"wohr\" as 1."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1610
#: xml_doc.cpp:6400
msgid "VARPA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "VARPA(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1611
#: xml_doc.cpp:6403
msgid "VARPA(12;5;7) equals 8.666..."
msgstr "VARPA(12;5;7) gifft \"8.666...\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1612
#: xml_doc.cpp:6406
msgid "VARPA(15;80;3) equals 1144.22..."
msgstr "VARPA(15;80;3) gifft \"1144.22...\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1613
#: xml_doc.cpp:6409
msgid "VARPA(6;7;8) equals 0.6666667..."
msgstr "VARPA(6;7;8) gifft \"0.6666667...\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1640
#: xml_doc.cpp:6424
msgid "The WEIBULL() function returns the Weibull distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon WEIBULL() gifft de \"Weibull\"-Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1641
#: xml_doc.cpp:6427
msgid ""
"The alpha and beta parameters must be positive, the number (first parameter) "
"must be non-negative."
msgstr ""
"De Parameters \"Alpha\" un \"Beta\" mööt positiv wesen, de Tall (eerst "
"Parameter) mutt nich-negativ wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1643
#: xml_doc.cpp:6433
msgid "WEIBULL(number;alpha;beta;cumulative)"
msgstr "WEIBULL(Tall;alpha;beta;kumulativ)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1644
#: xml_doc.cpp:6436
msgid "WEIBULL(2;1;1;0) equals 0.135335"
msgstr "WEIBULL(2;1;1;0) gifft \"0,135335\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1645
#: xml_doc.cpp:6439
msgid "WEIBULL(2;1;1;1) equals 0.864665"
msgstr "WEIBULL(2;1;1;1) gifft \"0,864665\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1657
#: xml_doc.cpp:6445
msgid "mean"
msgstr "Middelweert"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1661
#: xml_doc.cpp:6448
msgid "standardDeviation"
msgstr "Standardverscheel"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1665
#: xml_doc.cpp:6451
msgid ""
"The ZTEST() function calculates the two tailed probability of a z-test with "
"normal distribution."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ZTEST() reekt de twee tweesiedig Wohrschienlichkeit vun en z-"
"Test mit normaal Verdelen ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1666
#: xml_doc.cpp:6454
msgid "ZTEST(x; mean; standardDeviation)"
msgstr "ZTEST(x; Middel; Standardverscheel)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1673
#: xml_doc.cpp:6457
msgid ""
"Performs a test of the null hypothesis, that sample is a sample\n"
"            of a normal distributed random variable with mean mean and "
"standard\n"
"            deviation sigma. A return value of 1 indicates, that the null\n"
"            hypothesis is rejected, i.e. the sample is not a random sample "
"of\n"
"            the normal distribution.\n"
"            If sigma is omitted, it is estimated from sample, using STDEV.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Föhrt en Prööv vun de Nullhypothees dör, dat Muster is en Muster\n"
"            vun en normaal verdeelt tofällig Variabel mit middelt "
"Middelweert un Standardverscheel \n"
"            (Sigma). En Torüchgaav-Weert vun 1 bedüüdt, dat de "
"Nullhypothees\n"
"            afwiest wöör, d.h., dat Muster is keen tofällig Muster vun\n"
"            de Normaalverdelen.\n"
"            Wenn Sigma utlaten warrt, denn warrt dat mit STDEV vun't Muster "
"estemeert.\n"
"        "

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1726
#: xml_doc.cpp:6475
msgid "The BINO() function returns the binomial distribution."
msgstr "De Funkschoon BINO() gifft de binoomsch Verdelen torüch."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1727
#: xml_doc.cpp:6478
msgid ""
"The first parameter is the number of trials, the second parameter is the "
"number of successes, and the third is the probability of success. The number "
"of trials should be greater than the number of successes and the probability "
"should be smaller or equal to 1."
msgstr ""
"De eerste Parameter is de Tall vun Versöken, de twete de Tall vun Drepers un "
"de drüdde de Dreperwohrschienlichkeit. De Tall vun Versöken schall grötter "
"wesen as de Tall vun Drepers un de de Wohrschienlichkeit schall lütter oder "
"liek 1 wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1728
#: xml_doc.cpp:6481
msgid "BINO(trials;success;prob_of_success)"
msgstr "BINO(Versöken;Drepers;Dreperwohrschienlichkeit)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1729
#: xml_doc.cpp:6484
msgid "BINO(12;9;0.8) returns 0.236223201"
msgstr "BINO(12;9;0,8) gifft \"0,236223201\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1745
#: xml_doc.cpp:6493
msgid ""
"The SUMXMY2() function (SUM((X-Y)^2)) returns the square of the differences "
"of these values. The number of values in the two arrays should be equal. "
"Otherwise this function returns Err."
msgstr ""
"De \"SUMXMY2()\"-Funkschoon (SUM((X-Y)^2)) gifft dat Verscheelquadraat vun "
"disse Weerten torüch. De Tall vun Weerten binnen de twee Feller schall liek "
"wesen. Anners gifft disse Funkschoon \"Err\" torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1746
#: xml_doc.cpp:6496
msgid "SUMXMY2(array1;array2)"
msgstr "SUMXMY2(Feld1;Feld2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1747
#: xml_doc.cpp:6499
msgid "SUMXMY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) with A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 and B2=5, returns 1"
msgstr "SUMXMY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) mit A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 un B2=5 gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1763
#: xml_doc.cpp:6508
msgid "Probability of failure"
msgstr "Fehlslaagwohrschienlichkeit"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1767
#: xml_doc.cpp:6511
msgid ""
"The INVBINO() function returns the negative binomial distribution. The first "
"parameter is the number of trials, the second parameter is the number of "
"failures, and the third is the probability of failure. The number of trials "
"should be larger than the number of failures and the probability should be "
"smaller or equal to 1."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon INVBINO() gifft de negative binoomsch Verdelen torüch. De "
"eerste Parameter is de Tall vun Versöken, de twete de Tall vun Fehlslään, de "
"drüdde de Fehlslaagwohrschienlichkeit. De Tall vun Versöken schall grötter "
"wesen as de Tall vun Fehlslään un de Wohrschienlichkeit schall lütter oder "
"liek 1 wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1768
#: xml_doc.cpp:6514
msgid "INVBINO(trials;failure;prob_of_failure)"
msgstr "INVBINO(Versöök;Fehlslään;Fehlslaagwohrschienlichkeit)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1769
#: xml_doc.cpp:6517
msgid "INVBINO(12;3;0.2) returns 0.236223201"
msgstr "INVBINO(12;3;0,2) gifft \"0,236223201\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1781
#: xml_doc.cpp:6523
msgid ""
"The GAMMALN() function returns the natural logarithm of the gamma function: G"
"(x). The number parameter must be positive."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon GAMMALN() gifft de Gammafunkschoon G(x) ehr natürlich "
"Logaritmus torüch. De Parameter \"Tall\" mutt positiv wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1782
#: xml_doc.cpp:6526
msgid "GAMMALN(Number)"
msgstr "GAMMALN(Tall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/statistical.xml line 1783
#: xml_doc.cpp:6529
msgid "GAMMALN(2) returns 0"
msgstr "GAMMALN(2) gifft \"0\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 15
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 34
#: xml_doc.cpp:6538 xml_doc.cpp:6556
msgid "Decimals"
msgstr "Dezimaalsteden"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 19
#: xml_doc.cpp:6541
msgid ""
"The DOLLAR() function converts a number to text using currency format, with "
"the decimals rounded to the specified place. Although the name is DOLLAR, "
"this function will do the conversion according to the current locale."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DOLLAR() wannelt en Tall in't aktuelle Geldformaat na Text üm "
"un rundt de Nakommasteden as angeven. Ok wenn de Naam \"DOLLAR\" is, warrt "
"de lokaal instellt Geldsort ümwannelt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 20
#: xml_doc.cpp:6544
msgid "DOLLAR(number;decimals)"
msgstr "DOLLAR(Tall;Dezimaalsteden)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 21
#: xml_doc.cpp:6547
msgid "DOLLAR(1403.77) returns \"$ 1,403.77\""
msgstr "DOLLAR(1403,77) gifft \"\"EUR 1 403,77\"\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 22
#: xml_doc.cpp:6550
msgid "DOLLAR(-0.123;4) returns \"$-0.1230\""
msgstr "DOLLAR(-0,123;4) gifft \"EUR -0,1230\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 38
#: xml_doc.cpp:6559
msgid "No_commas"
msgstr "Keen_trenntekens"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 42
#: xml_doc.cpp:6562
msgid ""
"The FIXED() function rounds a number to the specified number of decimals, "
"formats the number in decimal format string, and returns the result as text. "
"If decimals is negative, number is rounded to the left of the decimal point. "
"If you omit decimals, it is assumed to be 2. If optional parameter no_commas "
"is True, thousand separators will not show up."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FIXED() rundt en Tall na de angeven Tall vun Dezimaalsteden, "
"formateert ehr as en Dezimaalformaat-Tekenkeed un gifft dat Resultaat as "
"Text ut. Wenn \"Dezimaalsteden\" negativ is, warrt de Tall links den "
"Dezimaalpunkt rundt. Ahn \"Dezimaalsteden\" warrt \"2\" vermoodt. Wenn de "
"optschonaal Parameter \"keen_trenntekens\" wohr is, warrt de Dusennerkoppels "
"ahn Trenntekens wiest."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 43
#: xml_doc.cpp:6565
msgid "FIXED(number;decimals;no_commas)"
msgstr "FIXED(Tall;Dezimaalsteden;Keen_trenntekens)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 44
#: xml_doc.cpp:6568
msgid "FIXED(1234.567;1) returns \"1,234.6\""
msgstr "FIXED(1234,567;1) gifft \"1 234,6\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 45
#: xml_doc.cpp:6571
msgid "FIXED(1234.567;1;FALSE) returns \"1234.6\""
msgstr "FIXED(1234,567;1;wohr) gifft \"1234,6\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 46
#: xml_doc.cpp:6574
msgid "FIXED(44.332) returns \"44.33\""
msgstr "FIXED(44,332) gifft \"44,33\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 54
#: xml_doc.cpp:6577
msgid "Text for which you want to substitute"
msgstr "Text, binnen den utwesselt warrn schall"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 58
#: xml_doc.cpp:6580
msgid "Part of text you want to replace"
msgstr "Deel vun den Text, de utwesselt warrn schall"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 62
#: xml_doc.cpp:6583
msgid "New text which will be replacement"
msgstr "Nieg Utwesseltext"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 66
#: xml_doc.cpp:6586
msgid "Which occurrence to replace"
msgstr "Utwesselvörkamen"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 70
#: xml_doc.cpp:6589
msgid ""
"The SUBSTITUTE() substitutes new_text for old_text in a text string. If "
"instance_num is specified, only that instance of old_text is replaced. "
"Otherwise, every occurrence of old_text is changed to new_text. Use "
"SUBSTITUTE when you want to replace specific text, use REPLACE when you want "
"to replace any text that occurs in a specific location."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SUBSTITUTE() wesselt binnen en Tekenkeed \"Oolt_Text\" dör "
"\"Nieg_Text\" ut. Wenn \"Utgaav_Tall\" angeven is, warrt bloots disse Tall "
"vun \"Oolt_Text\" utwesselt. Anners warrt elk Vörkamen vun \"Oolt_Text\" na "
"\"Nieg_Text\" ännert. Bruuk \"SUBSTITUTE\" för't Utwesseln vun angeven Text "
"un \"REPLACE\" för't Utwesseln vun Text an en angeven Steed."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 71
#: xml_doc.cpp:6592
msgid "SUBSTITUTE(text; old_text; new_text; instance_num)"
msgstr "SUBSTITUTE(Text; Oolt_Text; Nieg_Text; Utgaav_Tall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 72
#: xml_doc.cpp:6595
msgid "SUBSTITUTE(\"Cost Data\";\"Cost\";\"Sales\") returns \"Sales Data\""
msgstr ""
"SUBSTITUTE(\"Köstendaten\";\"Kösten\";\"Verkoop\") gifft \"Verkoopdaten\" ut"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 73
#: xml_doc.cpp:6598
msgid "SUBSTITUTE(\"Qtr 1, 2001\";\"1\";\"3\";1) returns \"Qtr 3, 2001\""
msgstr ""
"SUBSTITUTE(\"Quartaal 1, 2001\";\"1\";\"3\";1) gifft \"Quartaal 3, 2001\" "
"torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 74
#: xml_doc.cpp:6601
msgid "SUBSTITUTE(\"Qtr 1, 2001\";\"1\";\"3\";4) returns \"Qtr 3, 2003\""
msgstr ""
"SUBSTITUTE(\"Quartaal 1, 2001\";\"1\";\"3\";4) gifft \"Quartaal 3, 2003\" "
"torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 84
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 228
#: xml_doc.cpp:6604 xml_doc.cpp:6739
msgid "The text you want to find"
msgstr "Sööktext"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 88
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 232
#: xml_doc.cpp:6607 xml_doc.cpp:6742
msgid "The text which may contain find_text"
msgstr "De Text, de villicht \"Sööktext\" bargt"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 92
#: xml_doc.cpp:6610
msgid "Specified index to start the search"
msgstr "Angeven Index för den Söökanfang"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 96
#: xml_doc.cpp:6613
msgid ""
"The SEARCH() function finds one text string (find_text) within another text "
"string (within_text) and returns the number of the starting point of "
"find_text, from the leftmost character of within_text."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SEARCH() söökt en Text \"Sööktext\" binnen de Tekenkeed "
"\"binnen_dissen_Text\" un gifft \"Sööktext\" sien Startpositschoon af dat "
"eerste linke Teken binnen \"binnen_dissen_Text\" ut."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 97
#: xml_doc.cpp:6616
msgid ""
"You can use wildcard characters, question mark (?) and asterisk (*). A "
"question mark matches any single character, an asterisk matches any "
"sequences of characters."
msgstr ""
"Platzhollers sünd Fraagteken (?) un Steern (*). En Fraagteken steiht för "
"enkelte Tekens un en Steern för jichtenseen Tekenkeed."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 98
#: xml_doc.cpp:6619
msgid ""
"Parameter start_num specifies the character at which to start the search. "
"The first character is character number 1. If start_num is omitted, it is "
"assumed to be 1. SEARCH does not distinguish between uppercase and lowercase "
"letters."
msgstr ""
"De Parameter \"Startnummer\" gifft dat Teken an, af dat de Söök start. Dat "
"eerste Teken is Teken Nr. 1. Ahn \"Startnummer\" warrt \"1\" annahmen. "
"SEARCH ünnerscheedt nich twischen Groot- un Lüttschrieven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 99
#: xml_doc.cpp:6622
msgid "SEARCH(find_text;within_text;start_num)"
msgstr "SEARCH(Sööktext;binnen_dissen_Text;Startnummer)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 100
#: xml_doc.cpp:6625
msgid "SEARCH(\"e\";\"Statements\";6) returns 7"
msgstr "SEARCH(\"e\";\"Kommentaren\";6) gifft \"10\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 101
#: xml_doc.cpp:6628
msgid "SEARCH(\"margin\";\"Profit Margin\") returns 8"
msgstr "SEARCH(\"Rebeet\";\"Winnstrebeet\") gifft 7 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 114
#: xml_doc.cpp:6634
msgid ""
"The T() function returns the text referred to by value. If value is, or "
"refers to, text then T returns value. If value does not refer to text then T "
"returns empty text."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon T() gifft den Betogtext vun \"Weert\" torüch. Wenn \"Weert\" "
"en Text oder Textbetog is, gifft \"T\" den Weert torüch, wenn nich, warrt en "
"leddigTekenkeed torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 115
#: xml_doc.cpp:6637
msgid "T(value)"
msgstr "T(Weert)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 116
#: xml_doc.cpp:6640
msgid "T(\"KOffice\") returns \"KOffice\""
msgstr "T(\"KOffice\") gifft \"KOffice\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 117
#: xml_doc.cpp:6643
msgid "T(1.2) returns \"\" (empty text)"
msgstr "T(1,2) gifft \"\" torüch (leddig Text)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 129
#: xml_doc.cpp:6649
msgid "The TEXT() function converts a value to text."
msgstr "De Funkschoon TEXT() wannelt en Weert na Text üm."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 130
#: xml_doc.cpp:6652
msgid "TEXT(value)"
msgstr "TEXT(Weert)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 131
#: xml_doc.cpp:6655
msgid "TEXT(1234.56) returns \"1234.56\""
msgstr "TEXT(1234,56) gifft \"1234,56\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 132
#: xml_doc.cpp:6658
msgid "TEXT(\"KSpread\") returns \"KSpread\""
msgstr "TEXT(\"KSpread\") gifft \"KSpread\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 140
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 179
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 183
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 282
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 297
#: xml_doc.cpp:6661 xml_doc.cpp:6697 xml_doc.cpp:6700 xml_doc.cpp:6793
#: xml_doc.cpp:6808
msgid "String"
msgstr "Tekenkeed"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 144
#: xml_doc.cpp:6664
msgid ""
"The PROPER() function converts the first letter of each word to uppercase "
"and the rest of the letters to lowercase."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon PROPER() wannelt den eersten Bookstaav vun elk Woort na "
"Grootschrieven üm un den Rest na Lüttschrieven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 145
#: xml_doc.cpp:6667
msgid "PROPER(string)"
msgstr "PROPER(Tekenkeed)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 146
#: xml_doc.cpp:6670
msgid "PROPER(\"this is a title\") returns \"This Is A Title\""
msgstr "PROPER(\"dat is en titel\") gifft \"Dat Is En Titel\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 154
#: xml_doc.cpp:6673
msgid "First string"
msgstr "Eerst Tekenkeed"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 158
#: xml_doc.cpp:6676
msgid "String to compare with"
msgstr "Tekenkeed, mit de vergleken warrn schall"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 162
#: xml_doc.cpp:6679
msgid "Compare case-sensitive (true/false)"
msgstr "Bi't Verglieken op Groot-/Lüttschrieven oppassen (wohr/falsch)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 166
#: xml_doc.cpp:6682
msgid ""
"The COMPARE() function returns 0 if the two strings are equal; -1 if the "
"first one is lower in value than the second one; otherwise it returns 1."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon COMPARE() gifft \"0\" torüch, wenn de twee Tekenkeden gliek "
"sünd, un \"-1\", wenn de eerste Tekenkeed sieter is. Anners warrt \"1\" "
"torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 167
#: xml_doc.cpp:6685
msgid "COMPARE(string1; string2; true|false)"
msgstr "COMPARE(Tekenkeed1; Tekenkeed2; wohr|falsch)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 168
#: xml_doc.cpp:6688
msgid "COMPARE(\"KOffice\"; \"KOffice\"; true) returns 0"
msgstr "COMPARE(\"KOffice\"; \"KOffice\"; wohr) gifft \"0\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 169
#: xml_doc.cpp:6691
msgid "COMPARE(\"koffice\"; \"KOffice\"; true) returns 1"
msgstr "COMPARE(\"koffice\"; \"KOffice\"; wohr) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 170
#: xml_doc.cpp:6694
msgid "COMPARE(\"kspread\"; \"KOffice\"; false) returns 1"
msgstr "COMPARE(\"kspread\"; \"KOffice\"; falsch) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 187
#: xml_doc.cpp:6703
msgid ""
"The EXACT() function returns True if these two strings are equal. Otherwise, "
"it returns False."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon EXACT() gifft \"wohr\" torüch, wenn disse twee Tekenkeden "
"gliek sünd. Anners warrt \"falsch\" torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 188
#: xml_doc.cpp:6706
msgid "EXACT(string1;string2)"
msgstr "EXACT(Tekenkeed1;Tekenkeed2)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 189
#: xml_doc.cpp:6709
msgid "EXACT(\"KOffice\";\"KOffice\") returns True"
msgstr "EXACT(\"KOffice\";\"KOffice\") gifft \"wohr\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 190
#: xml_doc.cpp:6712
msgid "EXACT(\"KSpread\";\"KOffice\") returns False"
msgstr "EXACT(\"KSpread\";\"KOffice\") gifft \"falsch\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 199
#: xml_doc.cpp:6715
msgid "Text which you want to replace some characters"
msgstr "Text, binnen den en poor Tekens utwesselt warrn schöölt"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 203
#: xml_doc.cpp:6718
msgid "Position of the characters to replace"
msgstr "Positschoon vun de Tekens, de utwesselt warrn schöölt"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 207
#: xml_doc.cpp:6721
msgid "Number of characters to replace"
msgstr "Tall vun Tekens, de utwesselt warrn schöölt"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 211
#: xml_doc.cpp:6724
msgid "The text that will replace characters in old text"
msgstr "Utwesseltext"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 215
#: xml_doc.cpp:6727
msgid ""
"The REPLACE() function replaces part of a text string with a different text "
"string."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon REPLACE() wesselt en Deel vun en Tekenkeed dör en anner Text-"
"Tekenkeed ut."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 216
#: xml_doc.cpp:6730
msgid "REPLACE(text;position;length;new_text)"
msgstr "REPLACE(Text;Positschoon;Längde;Nieg_Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 217
#: xml_doc.cpp:6733
msgid "REPLACE(\"abcdefghijk\";6;5;\"-\") returns \"abcde-k\""
msgstr "REPLACE(\"abcdefghijk\";6;5;\"-\") gifft \"abcde-k\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 218
#: xml_doc.cpp:6736
msgid "REPLACE(\"2002\";3;2;\"03\") returns \"2003\""
msgstr "REPLACE(\"2002\";3;2;\"03\") gifft \"2003\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 236
#: xml_doc.cpp:6745
msgid "Specifies index to start the search"
msgstr "Leggt den Index för den Söökanfang fast"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 240
#: xml_doc.cpp:6748
msgid ""
"The FIND() function finds one text string (find_text) within another text "
"string (within_text) and returns the number of the starting point of "
"find_text, from the leftmost character of within_text."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon FIND() söcht en Tekenkeed (Sööktext) binnen en anner Tekenkeed "
"(binnen_dissen_Text) un gifft de Nummer vun de Startpositschoon vun "
"\"Sööktext\" vun dat sietste Teken vun \"binnen_dissen_Text\" ut."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 241
#: xml_doc.cpp:6751
msgid ""
"Parameter start_num specifies the character at which to start the search. "
"The first character is character number 1. If start_num is omitted, it is "
"assumed to be 1."
msgstr ""
"De Parameter \"Startnummer\" leggt dat Startteken för de Söök fast. Dat "
"eerste Teken is Teken Nummer 1. Wenn \"Startnummer\" weglaten is, warrt \"1"
"\" vermoodt."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 242
#: xml_doc.cpp:6754
msgid ""
"You can also use function SEARCH, but unlike SEARCH, FIND is case-sensitive "
"and does not allow wildcard characters."
msgstr ""
"Een kann ok de Funkschoon SEARCH() bruken, man anners as SEARCH() un FIND() "
"passt se op Groot-/Lüttschrieven un op un lett keen Platzhollers to."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 243
#: xml_doc.cpp:6757
msgid "FIND(find_text;within_text;start_num)"
msgstr "FIND(Sööktext;binnen_dissen_Text;Startnummer)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 244
#: xml_doc.cpp:6760
msgid "FIND(\"KOf\";\"KOffice\") returns 1"
msgstr "FIND(\"KOf\";\"KOffice\") gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 245
#: xml_doc.cpp:6763
msgid "FIND(\"i\";\"KOffice\") returns 5"
msgstr "FIND(\"i\";\"KOffice\") gifft \"5\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 246
#: xml_doc.cpp:6766
msgid "FIND(\"K\";\"KSpread in KOffice\";4) returns 12"
msgstr "FIND(\"K\";\"KSpread in KOffice\";4) gifft \"12\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 256
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 341
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 363
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 385
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 420
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 438
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 452
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 467
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 484
#: xml_doc.cpp:6769 xml_doc.cpp:6844 xml_doc.cpp:6865 xml_doc.cpp:6886
#: xml_doc.cpp:6922 xml_doc.cpp:6940 xml_doc.cpp:6952 xml_doc.cpp:6964
#: xml_doc.cpp:6979
msgid "Source string"
msgstr "Born-Tekenkeed"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 260
#: xml_doc.cpp:6772
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Positschoon"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 264
#: xml_doc.cpp:6775
msgid "Length"
msgstr "Längde"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 268
#: xml_doc.cpp:6778
msgid ""
"The MID() function returns a substring that contains 'length' characters of "
"the string, starting at 'position' index."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MID() gifft en Deeltekenkeed torüch, de \"Längde\" Tekens ut "
"de Tekenkeed bargt un an Positschoon \"Index\" start."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 269
#: xml_doc.cpp:6781
msgid "MID(text;position;length)"
msgstr "MID(Text;Positschoon;Längde)"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 270
#: xml_doc.cpp:6784
msgid "MID(text;position)"
msgstr "MID(Text;Positschoon)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 271
#: xml_doc.cpp:6787
msgid "MID(\"KOffice\";2;3) returns \"Off\""
msgstr "MID(\"KOffice\";2;3) gifft \"Off\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 272
#: xml_doc.cpp:6790
msgid "MID(\"KOffice\";2) returns \"Office\""
msgstr "MID(\"KOffice\";2) gifft \"Office\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 286
#: xml_doc.cpp:6796
msgid "The LEN() function returns the length of the string."
msgstr "De Funkschoon LEN() gifft en Tekenkeed ehr Längde torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 287
#: xml_doc.cpp:6799
msgid "LEN(text)"
msgstr "LEN(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 288
#: xml_doc.cpp:6802
msgid "LEN(\"hello\") returns 5"
msgstr "LEN(\"Moin\") gifft \"4\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 289
#: xml_doc.cpp:6805
msgid "LEN(\"KSpread\") returns 7"
msgstr "LEN(\"KSpread\") gifft \"7\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 301
#: xml_doc.cpp:6811
msgid "The TRIM() function returns text with only single spaces between words."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TRIM() gifft Text mit enkelte Leertekens twischen de Wöör "
"torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 302
#: xml_doc.cpp:6814
msgid "TRIM(text)"
msgstr "TRIM(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 303
#: xml_doc.cpp:6817
msgid "TRIM(\" hello    KSpread   \") returns \"hello KSpread\""
msgstr "TRIM(\" Moin    KSpread   \") gifft \"Moin KSpread\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 331
#: xml_doc.cpp:6835
msgid ""
"The CONCATENATE() function returns a string which is the concatenation of "
"the strings passed as parameters."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CONCATENATE() gifft en Tekenkeed torüch, de en Keed ut all as "
"Parameters övergeven Tekenkeden is."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 332
#: xml_doc.cpp:6838
msgid "CONCATENATE(value;value;...)"
msgstr "CONCATENATE(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 333
#: xml_doc.cpp:6841
msgid ""
"CONCATENATE(\"KSpread\";\"KOffice\";\"KDE\") returns \"KSpreadKOfficeKDE\""
msgstr ""
"CONCATENATE(\"KSpread\";\"KOffice\";\"KDE\") gifft \"KSpreadKOfficeKDE\" "
"torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 345
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 367
#: xml_doc.cpp:6847 xml_doc.cpp:6868
msgid "Number of characters"
msgstr "Tall vun Tekens"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 349
#: xml_doc.cpp:6850
msgid ""
"The RIGHT() function returns a substring that contains the 'length' "
"rightmost characters of the string. The whole string is returned if 'length' "
"exceeds the length of the string."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon RIGHT() gifft en Ünner-Tekenkeed torüch, de so veel vun de "
"Tekens heel rechts bargt, as dör \"Längde\" fastleggt is. Wenn \"Längde\" "
"grötter is as de Tekenkeedlängde, warrt de heel Tekenkeed torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 350
#: xml_doc.cpp:6853
msgid "RIGHT(text;length)"
msgstr "RIGHT(Text;Längde)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 351
#: xml_doc.cpp:6856
msgid "RIGHT(\"hello\";2) returns \"lo\""
msgstr "RIGHT(\"Moin\";2) gifft \"in\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 352
#: xml_doc.cpp:6859
msgid "RIGHT(\"KSpread\";10) returns \"KSpread\""
msgstr "RIGHT(\"KSpread\";10) gifft \"KSpread\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 353
#: xml_doc.cpp:6862
msgid "RIGHT(\"KSpread\") returns \"d\""
msgstr "RIGHT(\"KSpread\") gifft \"d\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 371
#: xml_doc.cpp:6871
msgid ""
"The LEFT() function returns a substring that contains the 'length' leftmost "
"characters of the string. The whole string is returned if 'length' exceeds "
"the length of the string. It is an error for the number of characters to be "
"less than 0."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon LEFT() gifft en Ünner-Tekenkeed torüch, de so veel vun de "
"Tekens heel links bargt, as dör \"Längde\" fastleggt is. Wenn \"Längde\" "
"grötter is as de Tekenkeedlängde, warrt de heel Tekenkeed torüchgeven. De "
"Tall vun Tekens mutt nich lütter as \"0\" wesen."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 372
#: xml_doc.cpp:6874
msgid "LEFT(text;length)"
msgstr "LEFT(Text;Längde)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 373
#: xml_doc.cpp:6877
msgid "LEFT(\"hello\";2) returns \"he\""
msgstr "LEFT(\"Moin\";2) gifft \"Mo\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 374
#: xml_doc.cpp:6880
msgid "LEFT(\"KSpread\";10) returns \"KSpread\""
msgstr "LEFT(\"KSpread\";10) gifft \"KSpread\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 375
#: xml_doc.cpp:6883
msgid "LEFT(\"KSpread\") returns \"K\""
msgstr "LEFT(\"KSpread\") gifft \"K\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 389
#: xml_doc.cpp:6889
msgid "Count of repetitions"
msgstr "Tall vun Wedderhalen"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 393
#: xml_doc.cpp:6892
msgid ""
"The REPT() function repeats the first parameter as many times as by the "
"second parameter. The second parameter must not be negative, and this "
"function will return an empty string if the second parameter is zero (or "
"rounds down to zero)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon REPT() wedderhaalt den eersten Parameter as faken, as dör den "
"tweten Parameter angeven. De twete Parameter mutt nich negativ wesen, un "
"disse Funkschoon gifft en leddig Tekenkeed torüch, wenn de twete Parameter "
"Null is (oder rundt na Null af)."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 394
#: xml_doc.cpp:6895
msgid "REPT(text;count)"
msgstr "REPT(Text;Tall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 395
#: xml_doc.cpp:6898
msgid "REPT(\"KSpread\";3) returns \"KSpreadKSpreadKSpread\""
msgstr "REPT(\"KSpread\";3) gifft \"KSpreadKSpreadKSpread\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 396
#: xml_doc.cpp:6901
msgid "REPT(\"KSpread\";0) returns \"\""
msgstr "REPT(\"KSpread\";0) gifft \"\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 408
#: xml_doc.cpp:6907
msgid ""
"The ROT() function encrypts text by replacing each letter with the one 13 "
"places along in the alphabet. If the 13th position is beyond the letter Z, "
"it begins again at A (rotation)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ROT() verslötelt Text dör Utwesseln vun elk Bookstaav dör den "
"Bookstaav, de 13 Tekens later in't Alfabeet kummt. Wenn de 13. Positschoon "
"na \"Z\" liggt, geiht dat wedder mit \"A\" wieder (Rotatschoon)."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 409
#: xml_doc.cpp:6910
msgid ""
"By applying the encryption function again to the resulting text, you can "
"decrypt the text."
msgstr ""
"De rutkamen Text lett sik wedder opslöteln, wenn Een em nochmaal verslötelt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 410
#: xml_doc.cpp:6913
msgid "ROT(Text)"
msgstr "ROT(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 411
#: xml_doc.cpp:6916
msgid "ROT(\"KSpread\") returns \"XFcernq\""
msgstr "ROT(\"KSpread\") gifft \"XFcernq\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 412
#: xml_doc.cpp:6919
msgid "ROT(\"XFcernq\") returns \"KSpread\""
msgstr "ROT(\"XFcernq\") gifft \"KSpread\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 424
#: xml_doc.cpp:6925
msgid ""
"The TOGGLE() function changes lowercase characters to uppercase and "
"uppercase characters to lowercase."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TOGGLE() wannelt Lütt- na Grootschrieven un Groot- na "
"Lüttschrieven üm."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 425
#: xml_doc.cpp:6928
msgid "TOGGLE(text)"
msgstr "TOGGLE(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 426
#: xml_doc.cpp:6931
msgid "TOGGLE(\"hello\") returns \"HELLO\""
msgstr "TOGGLE(\"moin\") gifft \"MOIN\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 427
#: xml_doc.cpp:6934
msgid "TOGGLE(\"HELLO\") returns \"hello\""
msgstr "TOGGLE(\"MOIN\") gifft \"moin\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 428
#: xml_doc.cpp:6937
msgid "TOGGLE(\"HeLlO\") returns \"hElLo\""
msgstr "TOGGLE(\"MoiN\") gifft \"mOIn\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 442
#: xml_doc.cpp:6943
msgid ""
"The CLEAN() function removes every non-printable character from the string"
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CLEAN() deit all nich druckbor Tekens ut de Tekenkeed weg"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 443
#: xml_doc.cpp:6946
msgid "CLEAN(text)"
msgstr "CLEAN(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 444
#: xml_doc.cpp:6949
msgid "CLEAN(AsciiToChar(7) + \"HELLO\") returns \"HELLO\""
msgstr "CLEAN(AsciiToChar(7) + \"MOIN\") gifft \"MOIN\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 456
#: xml_doc.cpp:6955
msgid "The SLEEK() function removes all spaces from the string."
msgstr "De Funkschoon SLEEK() deit all Freetekens ut de Tekenkeed weg."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 457
#: xml_doc.cpp:6958
msgid "SLEEK(text)"
msgstr "SLEEK(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 458
#: xml_doc.cpp:6961
msgid "SLEEK(\"This is   some  text \") returns \"Thisissometext\""
msgstr "SLEEK(\"Dit    is en   Text  \") gifft \"DitisenText\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 471
#: xml_doc.cpp:6967
msgid "The UPPER() function converts a string to upper case."
msgstr "De Funkschoon UPPER() wannelt en Tekenkeed na Grootschrieven üm."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 472
#: xml_doc.cpp:6970
msgid "UPPER(text)"
msgstr "UPPER(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 473
#: xml_doc.cpp:6973
msgid "UPPER(\"hello\") returns \"HELLO\""
msgstr "UPPER(\"moin\") gifft \"MOIN\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 474
#: xml_doc.cpp:6976
msgid "UPPER(\"HELLO\") returns \"HELLO\""
msgstr "UPPER(\"MOIN\") gifft \"MOIN\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 488
#: xml_doc.cpp:6982
msgid "The LOWER() function converts a string to lower case."
msgstr "De Funkschoon LOWER() wannelt en Tekenkeed na Lüttschrieven üm."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 489
#: xml_doc.cpp:6985
msgid "LOWER(text)"
msgstr "LOWER(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 490
#: xml_doc.cpp:6988
msgid "LOWER(\"hello\") returns \"hello\""
msgstr "LOWER(\"moin\") gifft \"moin\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 491
#: xml_doc.cpp:6991
msgid "LOWER(\"HELLO\") returns \"hello\""
msgstr "LOWER(\"MOIN\") gifft \"moin\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 501
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 612
#: xml_doc.cpp:6994 xml_doc.cpp:7090
msgid "Character code"
msgstr "Tekenkode"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 505
#: xml_doc.cpp:6997
msgid "The CHAR() function returns the character specified by a number."
msgstr "De Funkschoon CHAR() gifft dat vun en Tall angeven Teken torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 506
#: xml_doc.cpp:7000
msgid "CHAR(code)"
msgstr "CHAR(Kode)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 507
#: xml_doc.cpp:7003
msgid "CHAR(65) returns \"A\""
msgstr "CHAR(65) gifft \"A\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 520
#: xml_doc.cpp:7009
msgid ""
"The CODE() function returns a numeric code for the first character in a text "
"string."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CODE() gifft för dat eerste Teken binnen en Tekenkeed en "
"numeersch Kode torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 521
#: xml_doc.cpp:7012
msgid "CODE(text)"
msgstr "CODE(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 522
#: xml_doc.cpp:7015
msgid "CODE(\"KDE\") returns 75"
msgstr "CODE(\"KDE\") gifft \"75\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 535
#: xml_doc.cpp:7021
msgid "Converts text string that represents a value to the real value.  "
msgstr ""
"Wannelt en Tekenkeed, de en Weert dorstellt, na den redigen Weert üm.  "

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 536
#: xml_doc.cpp:7024
msgid "VALUE(text)"
msgstr "VALUE(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 537
#: xml_doc.cpp:7027
msgid "VALUE(\"14.03\") returns 14.03"
msgstr "VALUE(\"14,03\") gifft \"14,03\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 545
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 574
#: xml_doc.cpp:7030 xml_doc.cpp:7060
msgid "Searched text"
msgstr "Sööktext"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 549
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 578
#: xml_doc.cpp:7033 xml_doc.cpp:7063
msgid "Regular expression"
msgstr "Reguleer Utdruck"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 553
#: xml_doc.cpp:7036
msgid "Default value (optional)"
msgstr "Standardweert (optschonaal)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 557
#: xml_doc.cpp:7039
msgid "Back-reference (optional)"
msgstr "Torüchbetog (optschonaal)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 561
#: xml_doc.cpp:7042
msgid ""
"Returns a part of the string that matches a regular expression. If the "
"string does not match the given regular expression, value specified as "
"default is returned."
msgstr ""
"Gifft den övereenstimmen Deel vun en reguleer Utdruck torüch. Wenn de "
"Tekenkeed nich mit den angeven reguleer Utdruck övereenstimmt, warrt de "
"angeven Standardweert torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 562
#: xml_doc.cpp:7045
msgid ""
"If a back-reference is provided, then the value of that back-reference is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"Wenn en Torüchbetog praatstellt warrt, warrt em sien Weert torüchgeven."

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 563
#: xml_doc.cpp:7048
msgid ""
"If no default value is given, an empty string is assumed. If no back-"
"reference is given, 0 is assumed (so that entire matching part is returned)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn keen Standardweert angeven is, warrt en leddig Tekenkeed vermoodt. Wenn "
"keen Torüchbetog angeven is, warrt 0 annahmen (so dat de heel övereenstimmen "
"Deel torüchgeven warrt)."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 564
#: xml_doc.cpp:7051
msgid "REGEXP(text; regexp; default; backref)"
msgstr "REGEXP(Text, reguleer Utdruck, Standardweert, Torüchbetog)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 565
#: xml_doc.cpp:7054
msgid "REGEXP(\"Number is   15.\";\"[0-9]+\") = \"15\" "
msgstr "REGEXP(\"Tall is   15.\";\"[0-9]+\") = \"15\" "

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 566
#: xml_doc.cpp:7057
msgid "REGEXP(\"15, 20, 26, 41\";\"([0-9]+), *[0-9]+$\";\"\";1) = \"26\" "
msgstr "REGEXP(\"15, 20, 26, 41\";\"([0-9]+), *[0-9]+$\";\"\";1) = \"26\" "

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 582
#: xml_doc.cpp:7066
msgid "Replacement"
msgstr "Utwesseln"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 586
#: xml_doc.cpp:7069
msgid "Replaces all matches of a regular expression with the replacement text"
msgstr "Wesselt all passen reguleer Utdrück dör den Utwesseltext ut"

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 587
#: xml_doc.cpp:7072
msgid "REGEXPRE(text; regexp; replacement)"
msgstr "REGEXPRE(Text, reguleer Utdruck, Utwesseltext)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 588
#: xml_doc.cpp:7075
msgid ""
"REGEXPRE(\"14 and 15 and 16\";\"[0-9]+\";\"num\") returns \"num and num and "
"num\""
msgstr ""
"REGEXPRE(\"14 un 15 un 16\";\"[0-9]+\";\"Tall\") gifft \"Tall un Tall un Tall"
"\""

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 600
#: xml_doc.cpp:7081
msgid ""
"The UNICODE() function returns a unicode code point for the first character "
"in a text string."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon UNICODE() gifft för dat eerste Teken binnen en Tekenkeed en "
"Unikode-Weert torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 601
#: xml_doc.cpp:7084
msgid "UNICODE(text)"
msgstr "UNICODE(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 602
#: xml_doc.cpp:7087
msgid "UNICODE(\"KDE\") returns 75"
msgstr "UNICODE(\"KDE\") gifft \"75\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 616
#: xml_doc.cpp:7093
msgid ""
"The UNICHAR() function returns the character specified by a unicode code "
"point."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon UNICHAR() gifft dat Teken torüch, dat vun en Unikode-Weert "
"angeven warrt."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 617
#: xml_doc.cpp:7096
msgid "UNICHAR(code)"
msgstr "UNICHAR(Kode)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 618
#: xml_doc.cpp:7099
msgid "UNICHAR(65) returns \"A\""
msgstr "UNICHAR(65) gifft \"A\" torüch"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 628
#: xml_doc.cpp:7102
msgid "Full width characters"
msgstr "Heelbreed Tekens"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 632
#: xml_doc.cpp:7105
msgid ""
"The ASC() function returns the half-width characters corresponding to the "
"full-width argument."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ASC() gifft de halvigbreed Tekens torüch, de en heelbreed "
"Argument tohöört."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 633
#: xml_doc.cpp:7108
msgid "ASC(text)"
msgstr "ASC(Text)"

#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 642
#: xml_doc.cpp:7111
msgid "Half-width characters"
msgstr "Halvigbreed Tekens"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 646
#: xml_doc.cpp:7114
msgid ""
"The JIS() function returns the full-width characters corresponding to the "
"half-width argument."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon JIS() gifft de heelbreed Tekens torüch, de en halvigbreed "
"Argument tohöört."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/text.xml line 647
#: xml_doc.cpp:7117
msgid "JIS(text)"
msgstr "JIS(Text)"

#. i18n: tag GroupName
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 4
#: xml_doc.cpp:7120
msgid "Trigonometric"
msgstr "Trigonometersch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 14
#: xml_doc.cpp:7126
msgid ""
"The COS() function returns the cosine of x, where x is given in radians."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon COS() gifft den Kosinus vun x torüch, x is in Bagenmaat "
"angeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 15
#: xml_doc.cpp:7129
msgid "COS(Float)"
msgstr "COS(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 16
#: xml_doc.cpp:7132
msgid "COS(0) equals 1.0"
msgstr "COS(0) is 1,0"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 17
#: xml_doc.cpp:7135
msgid "COS(PI()/2) equals 0"
msgstr "COS(PI/2) is 0,0"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 31
#: xml_doc.cpp:7141
msgid "The ACOT() function returns the inverse cotangent of a number."
msgstr "De Funkschoon ACOT() gifft den invers Kotangens vun en Tall torüch."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 32
#: xml_doc.cpp:7144
msgid "ACOT(Float)"
msgstr "ACOT(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 33
#: xml_doc.cpp:7147
msgid "ACOT(0) equals 1.57079633"
msgstr "ACOT(0) is 1,57079633"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 46
#: xml_doc.cpp:7153
msgid "The SIN() function returns the sine of x, where x is given in radians."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SIN() gifft den Sinus vun x torüch, x is in Bagenmaat angeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 47
#: xml_doc.cpp:7156
msgid "SIN(Float)"
msgstr "SIN(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 48
#: xml_doc.cpp:7159
msgid "SIN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "SIN(0) is 0"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 49
#: xml_doc.cpp:7162
msgid "SIN(PI()/2) equals 1"
msgstr "SIN(PI/2) is 1"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 63
#: xml_doc.cpp:7168
msgid ""
"The TAN() function returns the tangent of x, where x is given in radians."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TAN() gifft den Tangens vun x torüch, x is in Bagenmaat "
"angeven."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 64
#: xml_doc.cpp:7171
msgid "TAN(Float)"
msgstr "TAN(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 65
#: xml_doc.cpp:7174
msgid "TAN(0.7) equals 0.84228838"
msgstr "TAN(0,7) gifft 0,84228838 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 66
#: xml_doc.cpp:7177
msgid "TAN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "TAN(0) gifft 0 torüch"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 79
#: xml_doc.cpp:7183
msgid ""
"The ACOS() function returns the arc cosine in radians and the value is "
"mathematically defined to be 0 to PI (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ACOS() gifft den Arkuskosinus in Bagenmaat torüch un de Weert "
"is mathemaatsch twischen 0 un PI fastleggt (inklusiv)."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 80
#: xml_doc.cpp:7186
msgid "ACOS(Float)"
msgstr "ACOS(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 81
#: xml_doc.cpp:7189
msgid "ACOS(0.8) equals 0.6435011"
msgstr "ACOS(0,8) is 0,6435011"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 82
#: xml_doc.cpp:7192
msgid "ACOS(0) equals 1.57079633"
msgstr "ACOS(0) is 1,57079633"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 95
#: xml_doc.cpp:7198
msgid ""
"The ASIN() function returns the arc sine in radians and the value is "
"mathematically defined to be -PI/2 to PI/2 (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ASIN() gifft den Arkussinus in Bagenmaat torüch un de Weert is "
"mathemaatsch twischen -PI/2 un PI/2 fastleggt (inklusiv)."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 96
#: xml_doc.cpp:7201
msgid "ASIN(Float)"
msgstr "ASIN(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 97
#: xml_doc.cpp:7204
msgid "ASIN(0.8) equals 0.92729522"
msgstr "ASIN(0,8) is 0.92729522"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 98
#: xml_doc.cpp:7207
msgid "ASIN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "ASIN(0) is 0"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 111
#: xml_doc.cpp:7213
msgid ""
"The ATAN() function returns the arc tangent in radians and the value is "
"mathematically defined to be -PI/2 to PI/2 (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ATAN() gifft den Arkustangens in Bagenmaat torüch un de Weert "
"is mathemaatsch twischen -PI/2 un PI/2 fastleggt (inklusiv)."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 112
#: xml_doc.cpp:7216
msgid "ATAN(Float)"
msgstr "ATAN(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 113
#: xml_doc.cpp:7219
msgid "ATAN(0.8) equals 0.67474094"
msgstr "ATAN(0,8) is 0,67474094"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 114
#: xml_doc.cpp:7222
msgid "ATAN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "ATAN(0) is 0"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 128
#: xml_doc.cpp:7228
msgid ""
"The COSH() function returns the hyperbolic cosine of x, which is defined "
"mathematically as (exp(x) + exp(-x)) / 2."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon COSH() gifft den hyperboolsch Kosinus vun x torüch, de "
"mathemaatsch as (exp(x) + exp(-x)) / 2 fastleggt is."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 129
#: xml_doc.cpp:7231
msgid "COSH(Float)"
msgstr "COSH(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 130
#: xml_doc.cpp:7234
msgid "COSH(0.8) equals 1.33743495"
msgstr "COSH(0,8) is 1,33743495"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 131
#: xml_doc.cpp:7237
msgid "COSH(0) equals 1"
msgstr "COSH(0) is 1"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 144
#: xml_doc.cpp:7243
msgid ""
"The SINH() function returns the hyperbolic sine of x, which is defined "
"mathematically as (exp(x) - exp(-x)) / 2."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SINH() gifft den hyperboolsch Sinus vun x torüch, de "
"mathemaatsch as (exp(x) - exp(-x)) / 2 fastleggt is."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 145
#: xml_doc.cpp:7246
msgid "SINH(Float)"
msgstr "SINH(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 146
#: xml_doc.cpp:7249
msgid "SINH(0.8) equals 0.88810598"
msgstr "SINH(0,8) is 0,88810598"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 147
#: xml_doc.cpp:7252
msgid "SINH(0) equals 0"
msgstr "SINH(0) is 0"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 160
#: xml_doc.cpp:7258
msgid ""
"The TANH() function returns the hyperbolic tangent of x, which is defined "
"mathematically as sinh(x)/cosh(x)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TANH() gifft den hyperboolschTangens vun x torüch, de "
"mathemaatsch as sinh(x) / cosh(x) fastleggt is."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 161
#: xml_doc.cpp:7261
msgid "TANH(Float)"
msgstr "TANH(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 162
#: xml_doc.cpp:7264
msgid "TANH(0.8) equals 0.66403677"
msgstr "TANH(0,8) is 0,66403677"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 163
#: xml_doc.cpp:7267
msgid "TANH(0) equals 0"
msgstr "TANH(0) is 0"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 176
#: xml_doc.cpp:7273
msgid ""
"The ACOSH() function calculates the inverse hyperbolic cosine of x. That is "
"the value whose hyperbolic cosine is x. If x is less than 1.0, acosh() "
"returns not-a-number (NaN) and errno is set."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ACOSH() reekt den invers hyperboolsch Kosinus vun x ut. Dat is "
"de Weert, den sien hyperboolsch Kosinus x is. Wenn x lütter as1,0 is, gifft "
"acosh() \"NaN\" (Not a Number = keen Tall) torüch un \"errno\" warrt sett."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 177
#: xml_doc.cpp:7276
msgid "ACOSH(Float)"
msgstr "ACOSH(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 178
#: xml_doc.cpp:7279
msgid "ACOSH(5) equals 2.29243167"
msgstr "ACOSH(5) is 2,29243167"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 179
#: xml_doc.cpp:7282
msgid "ACOSH(0) equals NaN"
msgstr "ACOSH(0) gifft \"NaN\" (Not a Number = Keen Tall)"

#. i18n: tag Text
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 192
#: xml_doc.cpp:7288
msgid ""
"The ASINH() function calculates the inverse hyperbolic sine of x; that is "
"the value whose hyperbolic sine is x."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ASINH() reekt den invers hyperboolsch Sinus vun x ut. Dat is "
"de Weert, den sien hyperboolsch Sinus x is."

#. i18n: tag Syntax
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 193
#: xml_doc.cpp:7291
msgid "ASINH(Float)"
msgstr "ASINH(Fleetkommatall)"

#. i18n: tag Example
#. i18n: file functions/trig.xml line 194
