#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:931
msgid ""
"This is the default format and KSpread autodetects the actual data type "
"depending on the current cell data. By default, KSpread right justifies "
"numbers, dates and times within a cell and left justifies anything else."
msgstr ""
"Dit is dat Standardformaat. De aktuell Datentyp warrt mit Hülp vun de "
"aktuellen Zelldaten automaatsch rutfunnen. Standardwies warrt Tallen, Datum- "
"un Tietangaven binnen en Zell rechterhand utricht, un all anner Indrääg "
"links."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:935
msgid ""
"The number notation uses the notation you globally choose in KControl -> "
"Regional & Accessibility -> Numbers tab. Numbers are right justified by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"De Schriefwies vun Tallen bruukt de systeemwiet fastleggten Instellen ut "
"\"Kuntrullzentrum\" -> \"Regioon un Toganghülp\" -> \"Land/Regioon un Spraak"
"\" ->\"Tallen\". Standardwies warrt Tallen rechterhand utricht."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:939
msgid ""
"When you have a number in the current cell and you switch from the dcell "
"format from Generic to Percent, the current cell number will be multiplied "
"by 100%.\n"
"For example if you enter 12 and set the cell format to Percent, the number "
"will then be 1,200 %. Switching back to Generic cell format will bring it "
"back to 12.\n"
"You can also use the Percent icon in the Format Toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Wenn binnen de aktuell Zell en Tall steiht un Een dat Zellformaat vun "
"\"Allgemeen\" na \"Perzent\" wesselt, warrt de aktuell Tall mit 100% "
"maalnahmen.\n"
"En Ingaav vun t.B. 12 warrt na't Wesseln vun't Zellformaat na Perzent to "
"1200% wannelt. Torüchwesseln na't allgemeen Zellformaat ännert se wedder na "
"12 üm.\n"
"Een kann dor ok dat Perzent-Lüttbild binnen den Formaat-Warktüüchbalken för "
"bruken."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:943
msgid ""
"The Money format converts your number into money notation using the settings "
"globally fixed in KControl in Regional & Accessibility -> Money. The "
"currency symbol will be displayed and the precision will be the one set in "
"KControl.\n"
"You can also use the Currency icon in the Format Toolbar to set the cell "
"formatting to look like your current currency."
msgstr ""
"Dat Geldformaat wannelt Dien Tall na de Geldschriefwies üm. Dor warrt de "
"systeemwieden Instellen ut \"Kuntrullzentrum\" -> \"Regioon un Toganghülp\" -"
">\"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Geld\" för bruukt. Dat Geldlüttbild warrt "
"wiest un de Nauigkeit bruukt, de in't Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt is.\n"
"Een kann för't Topassen ok dat Geldlüttbild ut den Formaat-Warktüüchbalken "
"bruken, dormit dat Zellformaat liek Dien aktuell Geldsort lett."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:946
msgid "Scientific"
msgstr "Wetenschaplich"

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:947
msgid ""
"The scientific format changes your number using the scientific notation. For "
"example, 0.0012 will be changed to 1.2E-03. Going back using Generic cell "
"format will display 0.0012 again."
msgstr ""
"Dat wetenschaplich Formaat ännert de Tall na de wetenschaplich Schriefwies, "
"t.B. 1,2E-03 ansteed vun 0,0012. Torüch na't Standard-Zellenformaat warrt "
"wedder 0,0012 wiest."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:951
msgid ""
"The fraction format changes your number into a fraction. For example, 0.1 "
"can be changed to 1/8, 2/16, 1/10, etc. You define the type of fraction by "
"choosing it in the field on the right. If the exact fraction is not possible "
"in the fraction mode you choose, the nearest closest match is chosen.\n"
" For example: when we have 1.5 as number, we choose Fraction and Sixteenths "
"1/16 the text displayed into cell is \"1 8/16\" which is an exact fraction. "
"If you have 1.4 as number in your cell and you choose Fraction and "
"Sixteenths 1/16 then the cell will display \"1 6/16\" which is the nearest "
"closest Sixteenth fraction."
msgstr ""
"Dat Brook-Formaat ännert de Tall na en Brook. So lett sik t.B. 0,1 na 1/8, "
"2/16, 1/10 usw. ännern. In't Feld rechterhand warrt de Brooktyp fastleggt. "
"Wenn de Brook mit den utsöchten Typ nich nau mööglich is, warrt de dichtst "
"bi leggen bruukt.\n"
"För t.B. 1,5 as Tall un wenn Brook un Sössteihndel 1/16 utsöcht is, warrt in "
"de Zell \"1 8/16\" wiest, wat en nau Brook is. För 1,4 as Tall un wenn Brook "
"un Sössteihndel 1/16 utsöcht is, warrt \"1 6/16\" wiest, wat de dichtst bi "
"liggen Sössteihndel-Brook is."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:954
msgid "Date format"
msgstr "Datumformaat"

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:955
msgid ""
"To enter a date, you should enter it in one of the formats set in KControl "
"in Regional & Accessibility ->Time & Dates. There are two formats set here: "
"the date format and the short date format.\n"
"Just like you can drag down numbers you can also drag down dates and the "
"next cells will also get dates."
msgstr ""
"En Datum schall in een vun de twee Tietformaten ingeven warrn, de in't "
"Kuntrullzentrum bi \"Regioon un Toganghülp\" -> \"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -"
"> \"Tiet un Datum\" fastleggt sünd. Hier laat sik twee Formaten instellen: "
"Dat Datumformaat un dat kort Datumformaat.\n"
"Liek Tallen sik daaltrecken laat, so laat sik ok Daten daaltrecken un de "
"nakamen Zellen bargt denn ok Daten."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:958
msgid "Time format"
msgstr "Tietformaat"

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:959
msgid ""
"This formats your cell content as a time. To enter a time, you should enter "
"it in the Time format set in KControl in Regional & Accessibility ->Time & "
"Dates. In the Cell Format dialog box you can set how the time should be "
"displayed by choosing one of the available time format options. The default "
"format is the system format set in KControl. When the number in the cell "
"does not make sense as a time, KSpread will display 00:00 in the global "
"format you have in KControl."
msgstr ""
"Dit formateert den Zellinholt as Tiet. En Tiet schall in't Tietformaat "
"ingeven warrn, dat in't Kuntrullzentrum bi \"Regioon un Toganghülp\" -> "
"\"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Tiet un Datum\" instellt is. In't Menü "
"\"Zellenformaat\" lett sik ut verscheden Formaten utsöken, wodennig de Tiet "
"wiest warrt. Dat Standardformaat is dat in't Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt "
"Systeemformaat. Wenn de Tall binnen de Zell sik nich as gellen Tietangaav "
"bruken lett, warrt 00:00 in't globaal Tietformaat wiest."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:963
msgid ""
"This formats your cell content as text. This can be useful if you want a "
"number treated as text instead as a number, for example for a ZIP code. "
"Setting a number as text format will left justify it. When numbers are "
"formatted as text, they cannot be used in calculations or formulas. It also "
"change the way the cell is justified."
msgstr ""
"Dit formateert den Zellinholt as Text. Dat kann wat bringen, wenn Een en "
"Tall as Text un nich as Tall behanneln will, t.B. en Postleddtall. En as "
"Text formateert Tall warrt linkerhand utricht. Wenn Tallen as Text "
"formateert warrt, laat se sik nich för't Utreken oder för Formeln bruken. "
"Dit ännert ok de Zellutrichten."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:966
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Egen"

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:967
msgid "The custom format does not work yet. To be enabled in the next release."
msgstr "Dat egen Formaat löppt noch nich. In en tokamen Utgaav villicht."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:978
msgid ""
